{'id': 'uNwRwW8yu-7J5nzfpXo8iw', 'title': '【巫师】男色经济，和它的变种们', 'author': '巫师财经', 'description': '', 'topic_image': 'https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFHaGomia18JRFFCLhs0ic89PrdVOibwFKs3Y8kznmLAmV927JpB9BgNPKPyKqFyb0DSSEibWzu1XejlgTojiaXEMibFRljghGwrndr8/0?wx_fmt=jpeg', 'publish_time': 1772787600, 'content': '<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    大家好我是巫师，来不及悼念物质消费的降级了，接下来登场的是：精神消费的升级——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    男色经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    说的不是工体三里屯夜店的无效social和模子消费，这些都是老登的土旧模式，消费升级伴随着的是形式革新，举个例子——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    恋陪本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; visibility: visible;">\n    恋陪模式\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; visibility: visible;">\n    故事or感情\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    传统剧本杀是体验一段故事，而恋陪本是体验一段感情\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    其核心资产是高颜值的男性DM（主持人）。也有店面将他们称为“男执”或“卡司”\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    剧情中常常包含拥抱，牵手、摸脸、十指相扣，靠肩膀，摸头，近距离对视、求婚和结婚、生离死别等场景\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFyaV11picWvjGyQUm66kZN3bBx8hq3xuTqEAe0xWzlSpQ40p7n4UZNPSluP9Ylx3SoINMjclibXUBFDVc4iaGTicFjybzhfVkDdFg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 233px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJH8RAvYBBlPmChic8ibY9q98WUeiaW7luLVuiacqBE5QT516Ea0z91FRxJjiahaQCzcGiazFic5FNXD6ZicpGNIoI6vGmMFzmgkjMSVib7E/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 317px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGtzagd1dCSzLibmBdBsjcQPicWQjocvJpt4n9ZkYcwdXXVpxtLyEk6KmcWibibyAJkShzRksc4iaHpKiank0AJOMgIYPTQCkpQAc0So/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 290px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJG1NE0eF8suxic81iabVlccjltia2688lRRibc6PrPusZU3fhCJHoYhsEQlNC08aJsxHVBl2wRalDNWggLvThHhGibbGKjMcDpiabol8/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 254px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFnarLXsDeMzuE46EuPnoFS1C9ss8dn6CMJFUp5of9Q10GfYeE0gQO54jOaQo4TyY0V65pGUSTicfxuD3SI2SicBtTqZdPkEszzM/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 246px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJED47jssXSEp4TjltLwGF3PTZRoDbSO3jl87PEyyvX66oRpqO3t3JK29y3KP06PcghWcCTZdVgBSOibzHfGjRoKGwGSUzBDPels/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 219px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHXMyCrXMPIFiaveibSSGYvibuGQiaXn78F6ttvDWWkicsdb4SVDtu2BUkOND71FdlcyzVs48QFpOq6OBQs2bs8xtqLAjnr7FzvOTP0/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 259px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFuyMFISTUI4uDeoibmTWiaL6ic7MQyrib0qvrFmsjtnat90f4MZddFHsDmibURliatM0eaQtF6cXiajCs5FibVVcuyADxvhW6qXsOsyok/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=7" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 316px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    激进的本儿会有公主抱，掐脖等互动，但也已经是极限了，这个商业模式去年就已经火了，后被多家媒体批判成低俗，并且添油加醋说什么这些店最后演变为提供有偿性服务，然后加上要抵制之类的话术，反正道德的高地先占上再说\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHRZl96XoEjW44qOicQibwVCXkOnnKJL1XRia0ju8XHE3lLLCHx0ollImVGEqLYsZo7UcBSMZydDm2x3NTvOIiaqqRfD4OIZwq4bPo/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=8" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 367px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGxE2qE0EX0TibzJmfKCJ4ZLFwfEhZnW0aVUAtDyOFHCGDUvHaQb4LyJYws5KTD4sPtxiaPibwe45VLfrzMic9WeFeaqQkhTU2SAJY/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=9" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 378px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但事实上，即使是在男色经济最发达的一线城市，其实都挺克制的，甚至有点雷声大雨点小的意思，而且在发车前，有大量的确认环节，也就是什么你能接受，什么不能接受，而且就算你接受，DM还不接受呢，条条框框很多\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而被媒体夸大升级为违法犯罪的，全是说我有个朋友，有个同学，然后怎么怎么样，经典桥断了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    素菜荤价\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但巫师也要辩证的看，比起那些标题党，我的视角是——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    素菜荤价\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    我们一层一层看\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    如果把恋陪和模子相比，那是纯纯\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    消费升级，品阶降级\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    一线城市的恋陪本的真实花销，也就是加上dm、场地，再加上当场的吃吃喝喝，就已经大几百的成本了，甚至还有很多千元以上的热门专场\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但这些成本反而是小头，大头有两大块\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    隐形成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    错位成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第一就是错位成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    很多消费者在选定一个本之后，选定了自己喜欢的dm之后，在参加这个本儿之前，会花大力气捯饬自己，这个捯饬可不是\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    画个全妆洗个头\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的等级，而是\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    服化道全上\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，比如自己花钱找人弄古偶的精致发型，加上相对应朝代的整套服装，当然也是为了自己出片，再有去买相关的道具，杂七杂八准备半天，这导致了一个很离谱的情况，就是消费者自己精心准备的造型下，一看照片，一时间分不清到底谁是玩家谁是恋陪DM，就是玩家比恋陪还精致，还高级，造成了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    到底谁在服务谁\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的这种【错位】\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    竞价\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    这还没完\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第二，就是这个市场已经衍生出了竞价和类似饭圈机制，对于个别比较帅且有名气的dm，大家得花费更多加钱去竞拍才能拿到他的档期，甚至有的商家很有创意的搞出了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    暗拍机制\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，然后被大家一顿吐槽，但这其实是典型的商业模式演化中必然会出现的市场化行为\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFBicQ4oeL77jZDPdd8Abib4diacDoJ1R87L9WkScgJFycPMdeiaemic59RohvkhD5GDwtHaAO0FIL64oEYerNHvQhWHa5R4v4HCuSk/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=10" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 493.75px !important; height: auto !important; background-color: transparent; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但这又还没完\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    打赏机制\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    随后出现了打赏机制，就是很多消费者，为了培养和自己欢喜的dm的感情，还要带上小礼物，这些礼物往往价值不菲，甚至还包括了奢侈品，同时在获得超预期的体验后，会在私下打赏，希望由此来“调校”DM的\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    正反馈心理\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，dm也乐得如此，由此更进一步，如果你给我送东西或者发红包，我就给你更牛逼的体验，更丰富的反馈\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但这又又又还没完，以上几个隐性成本虽然很吃经济，但这是有数的，相对可控的，巫师想说的最后一点，就是这个商业模式里面最不可控的一点了——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    上头成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    上头成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    不推演过程，直接给最终视角，曾爆出这样一张截图，大概是一个男dm炫耀自己干恋陪3个月，异性资源暴增\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    比当rapper更好的医美来了，没有恋陪本这些好事哪能轮到我\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEmejXjj2z65G0TKNibggNQrY4BiaicwJ9JibrYNnYBict7dqrj3JNOxicLM8rUM1e6viczDOAicibejud7miadQf08akcgicgYgZ4yyJEgibo/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=11" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    一张聊天记录的真实成分难以验证，只是反应出了该模式下更深的一层，就是消费者对dm上头之后，不但反复刷一个本，而且要和dm谈恋爱，这样的成本就不是几千块钱可以计量的了，最后爆出的各种瓜都是100%的BE\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    利益分配格局\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    这种模式改变了传统店家和DM的雇佣关系，现在更接近“MCN”或“夜场与公关”的合作模式。\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    平台方或者店方拿走门票收入的大头，男DM\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    底薪低，提成高\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    。甚至无底薪。这种形式下，头部效应极强，头部有名气的单明面上的收入就三五万一个月，私下打赏未知，而中腰部的收入断崖下降\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而以前还比较重要的剧本作者的地位又下降一档，话语权不断降低。因为剧情好坏和最最重要的【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    核诡\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】在这种模式下，不是刚需了，不再决定生死\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    近几年，类似于剧本杀密室女仆咖啡线下陪玩这些商业模式兴起，但在口罩时期和叠加线下经济的深度调整期，一半以上的剧本杀店已经倒闭，上海从顶峰2000多家下降到六七百家，巫师教你们一个词儿啊，就是你要说什么不行了，又怕敏感，你就说\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    行业繁荣度不及预期，供给侧进入深度调整期\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    从狼人杀店，桌游店变成了打本和密室，再到现在的恋陪，这背后，是传统的线下社交商业模式，偷偷靠向【男色经济】这种\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    盈利确定性更大，需求更刚性，利润溢价更高\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的商业模式，是整个行业供给者趋利避害的合理选择\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    男色消费变种\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    拍照搭子\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    如果说恋陪本还算是有中间商，那么很多人已经在平台上直接招贤纳士了，比如有人诚招帅哥来参加自己的毕业典礼，或者来拍毕业照\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    硬性要求是帅+身高183以上，不算鞋底不算头发的真实裸高，性取向不限，只要帅，需要帮忙送花，花钱雇主出，需要和雇主一块strong的从同学面前路过，从描述看是一位非常贴心的雇主了，但想必\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    对建模的要求极高\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，雇主也承认：本人阅帅哥无数，要求巨高，自认为“小帅”的被pass很正常，顶帅的话我花钱也会超大方的\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGj5vRCxhXejvicRv0Uaes8ynvy6bqsRJsbhicARgAhBuB6Jh4ic2ZbpxSoDibfm6mlrWxhw4Ticc7K3DicSy72B3khrvtbXVLibrr2vc/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=12" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 464px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    巫师本以为这是个例或者是在整活，但是经过研究发现，这个需求非常普遍，大量的帖子正在招贤纳士，大家的需求基本相似，价格在100-200元每小时不等，也就是如果忙乎四个小时的话，能收大几百块的报酬，雇员一般情况下提供全套“仪式感”。除了拍照，还负责提供情绪价值，当然还有当天的拿包拿衣服等助理类的琐碎工作\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHSZ9bK0aTUia1KMM3TkzWM4Cwkedib9WPriaXNVViaMPWG5qZgJXSm7byFvUZZXL5azMssSrjTvPFlgibL2hfUtqxJ6kOFAQR2JL90/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=13" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    然而这背后是一个巨大的市场，巫师说的不是毕业照，而是大家在平台上通过各种形式直接发帖雇佣小帅，另一种形式的Boss直聘了，这是典型的【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    平台经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】的雏形，只是现在还没有一个类似于【滴滴】之于出行需求的，能够完全收拢这种需求的单一平台\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    这种需求里面有各种花里胡哨的形式，但内核相似\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    拼好抱\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第一，"拼好抱"服务\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    就是付费寻找帅哥来一场拥抱。抱完各回各家。此帖迅速引发共鸣，之后大量用户形成效仿\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    还有人发布“抱后感”\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    搭子经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第二，搭子经济，搭子经济本质还是地陪的一种变种，但最主要的区别是，必须要帅，要高，做一天有偿的搭子，内容包含但不限于吃饭，看电影，唱k，游乐场、动物园、水族馆、骑行、室内运动、滑雪、逛公园，爬山等等等，更激进一点的要求对方提供暧昧氛围，但谢绝更进一步的肢体接触\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    相似的形式下，还有个壳，叫——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    陪拍师服务\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    "陪拍"师除了为客户提供拍照和修片服务，还可陪同逛街、游览景点，就像花钱请了一位能拍会玩的伴侣，当然，雇主需要的是一个帅哥伴侣而且要实时提供情绪价值和照顾，在对帅的要求下，对于拍照设备的要求反而放在了第二位，长枪短炮的设备装逼流在【帅】面前，瞬间显得一文不值\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEYicw5icy2cO6mxzvq4m5EBR9CanXZfWNk0wJueINUaT7lNV2Gichxw9LraXic6KonnU7g9GS3cGibPBUzKMR3FuKm2kgPZlzUxRYA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=14" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    无论是陪游，陪拍，一日搭子，或者一日男友等等服务，价格均在100-200元每小时，\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而在供给侧，有男生表示，自从做地陪后已经50次进出北京环球影城，一周内曾连续5天入园，熟悉到年卡通道的员工都认识他。为了提高服务品质，不少主打颜值的地陪，反而购置了专业补光套装、无人机等装备，也有人研究总结了很多景点“免排队”或逃票小窍门以此作为吸引顾客的噱头。当然，私下接单也存在诚信风险：对方临时爽约或“逃单”行为非常普遍\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    有博主分享自己雇佣“男大生地陪”的经历：先在社媒上筛选“男大”陪游的帖子，他们通常详细列出自己的服务信息：价格、年龄、身高体重、熟悉的景点、最重要的是大量的自拍展示面，经过最近一段时间的竞争，供给侧也是\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    卷起来了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    他会帮你设计行程攻略、购票安排，全程陪伴讲解，摄影甚至还附赠修图，热情聊天、夸夸不断，还有的自备交通工具，相当有服务意识\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    景区帅哥NPC\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第三，从2021年起，很多景区就开始批量雇佣"帅哥NPC"和“肌肉NPC”，这成为景区营销的新名片。从最开始的噱头，再到可以给游客提供简单合影，再到现在的百花齐放，很多景区已升级互动形式，牵手、拥抱、贴脸杀，借位接吻和喂棒棒糖等互动在社交媒体上爆火，很多景区也由此在短时间内获得大量流量，带动了当地的经济，当然自然又有一批媒体站在道德高地上一顿批判，说低俗什么的，虽然这些形式突破传统界限，但本质上还是逢场作戏，内核其实还是很克制，没有私下交易，男模本质还是商品属性，风险相较于前几种形式反而更加可控\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    集大成者\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    如果我们再把标准放宽，其实还有更多男色经济的场景正在冉冉升起\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    比如主打帅哥和肌肉男服务的【猛男餐厅】，对标的是以前的女仆餐厅\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再比如用帅哥引流的二次元酒吧或者执事咖啡馆\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再比如视频平台的各形式的团播，尤其是男团的团播\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHfUpXpTR9MZuxiaiaXU4sqDld7YRI7LhzicsB898BAhiaAzUzjgtVoaR99eR6eM4PCia6eswDgJHB8nSyibke8Hatj1E5eQWULbDJm4/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=15" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    以及男主播，"男模日记"赛道等等，以及后续衍生的消费，帅哥陪打游戏、语音陪伴、哄睡服务等等，当然重点还是帅，更重要的是声音好听\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    线上另一块比较大的就是女性向纸片人，比如沉浸式乙女游戏赛道下的国乙四大天王，以及不那么注重恋爱的群像养成游戏，主打陪伴、多角色\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再小众一点，就是女频图文消费，其中耽美赛道的粘性和客单价尤为优秀，这个赛道真的很有意思，研究半天写了一堆，但最后巫师还是把这段删了（心疼），想了想，还是不要被大众注意的好，不要回复，不要回复\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但如果我们穿透这些细碎复杂的商业模式，男色经济中最最最集大成者是什么，又回到咱们的领域了，\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    偶像经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    男偶像唯一提供的价值就是【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    性魅力\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】，这个理论巫师说了无数遍，别跟我犟嘴说什么演技唱功内核，偶像经济之所以称之为“集大成者”，表层是他们的覆盖人群规模最庞大，营收和利润比以上所有赛道加起来还要再加两个0，但巫师不想列数据\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    真正的牛逼之处在于水下，资本创造了一个“\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    负熵\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ”的商业奇迹： 它让一群本该是“上帝”的消费者，心甘情愿地成为了自带干粮、甚至倒贴钱的工具人\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    消费者付了钱，不但没被服务，反而要去劳动\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    "消费"包装成了"爱"，"被剥削"包装成"养成"，刷数据冲销量包装成了"战斗"，并且通过饭圈这个形式内部互相监督，形成压力闭环，消费者自己成了监工，监督其他消费者为资本劳动\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGSwcCVV1fcyfL2Ql48jdw759uqB20qYuibxfwsozKth7bG1p76xr2HvnAuhibTfVX9d7vcR6icg9O170xPGOwlrykmch0sGJ4QoU/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=16" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHVxw9GoKgmmic1ia7CicIyxhBuqXfiact0yks1SNBJShGBbn4VhgVFs3icB53gWoExNGO7ESrYWiclppa7qPMbXdl4kp24uNlCtC4nc/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=17" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    你是否还记得那句经典的——他只有我们了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    当然，偶像经济能达到如此大的规模自然有其合理性，巫师的明星与资本系列已经深度分析多次，巫师在投行职业生涯中把影视行业视为鄙视链最底层，幺蛾子多、引人注目，还都是小项目，烂项目，，只是这么多年明星与资本系列衍生出的无数暴论，你们可以当成商业思维启发的药引\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    男色经济的内核\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    跳出商业本身，我们拉到上帝视角\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    中国经济正在处于深度调整期，消费数据的趋势明显，背后是人们在“消费降级”和“理性回归”中不断探索\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJH9yKZBTFjY4YG14joiac4zibbcIuzscTuTzWzEPNO24P2Nh1ibsbkvgz86z8ImFD9jjbicgz0xA8n5adpeug9T8UUJmppiaBzic2u60/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=18" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    然而我们又势必要刺激内需拉动消费，下一个增长点，或许不一定非要在【物质消费】这个范围中寻找\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    截止2024，中国一人户家庭，占比接近1/5，这包含了全年龄段的独居者\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEp4FOwfubpvE7SLicdMn3U9TInRe2TZ3wHO6ULoRgP3NfibJWFJ7Iia6JiakyEUMib28ls2K16dQNLeWfHsBd9D5ucufrBkvy9TjdA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=19" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    同时，中国平均初婚年龄自2016年起快速提高，五年前的官方数据就已经接近30岁\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEymM4AgvD41XTtF2IC4L2rz64v0wUicOhfuVjiaiasrTibQRACdxjUZIHNicGWicpMofxF2qXf4ojYjv6T8xxIQmn5s191Myash2tOg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=20" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再有，工作节奏极限压缩社交机会，表面上每天都要应付很多人，但实际有效社交几乎为0的【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    新孤独态\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】成为打工人的常态\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    其实很早就有人向精神消费和情绪消费探索，但是之前很多所谓的精神消费，巫师看来可以归为两类\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第一类是：没事儿找事儿\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第二类是：脱了裤子放屁\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    然后都加上巨高的溢价，最后都沦为智商税筛选的笑柄\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    大家可以把你认为的符合这两类的消费打在公屏上\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而任何一个正在野蛮发展的赛道，往往说明这个需求来自本源，是真实存在的而不是吹出来的，这个赛道虽然听上去有点上不了台面，但其内核要相对温和的多\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    我们对比“男色经济”与“女色经济”的根本区别——即男性消费女色，中间披上了各种形式的外衣，但本质都是为了一个事儿，每个人都知道我在说什么，所以女色经济，其实\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    非常单一、且风险极高，往往处于灰色甚至黑色区域\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，而这些区域也成为灰黑产重要的引流池子\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而男色经济则正好相反，也就是女性可不是为了所谓的最后一步，而是指向\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    多维度的情感体验过程\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，这种多层次的需求，意味着商家可以创造出无数种不同的商品和服务SKU，从而形成一条长长的产业链，在每个环节都能产生溢价和GDP\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    男性是要结果\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    女性是要过程\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    上述的各种男色经济的形式，就是这条长长的，注重过程的需求中，创造的细分商业模式，这种\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    非线性、弥散状\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的需求，创造了比单纯的生理交易大得多的市场空间\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而【注重过程】这一重大区别，带来了另一大商业模式上的优势，就是“安全”与“温和，更不易涉及法律法规红线，从而让各种男色经济获得了在公域传播的合法性+合理性，甚至在需求不断释放，市场不断规范下，衍生为真正的平台经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    同时创造出\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    非体力的灵活就业\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    虽然现在部分商业模式还存在隐患，但很多新兴行业都经历过"\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    野蛮生长—乱象频发—监管和媒体监督介入—行业洗牌—规范化\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    "的周期\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    Ok。本期观点、文案、图表点个关注自取随便用，就说是你写的\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-bottom: 0px;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    资本永不眠，下期见\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style="display: none;">\n <mp-style-type data-value="3">\n </mp-style-type>\n</p>\n', 'mp_info': {'mp_name': '巫师财经', 'logo': 'https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/A5AZPRIiakEIhcjXobvFF8FDDoabQibiaMTW3LBXK5VD5ciaKeWYxQia4GxOHv8v6WJUkZwetGNGvWtUoanWNTuIgMQ/300?wx_fmt=png&wxfrom=18', 'biz': 'MzUzMzY4Njc0NA=='}, 'mp_id': 'MP_WXS_3533686744', 'article_type': 0, 'fetch_error': ''}
[SQL] UPDATE articles SET description=?, status=?, has_content=?, content=?, content_html=? WHERE articles.id = ?
[参数] ('<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    大家好我是巫师，来不及悼念物质消费的降级了，接下来登场的是：精神消费的升级——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    男色经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    说的不是工体三里屯夜店的无效social和模子消费，这些都是老登的土旧模式，消费升级伴随着的是形式革新，举个例子——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    恋陪本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; visibility: visible;">\n    恋陪模式\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; visibility: visible;">\n    故事or感情\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    传统剧本杀是体验一段故事，而恋陪本是体验一段感情\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    其核心资产是高颜值的男性DM（主持人）。也有店面将他们称为“男执”或“卡司”\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    剧情中常常包含拥抱，牵手、摸脸、十指相扣，靠肩膀，摸头，近距离对视、求婚和结婚、生离死别等场景\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFyaV11picWvjGyQUm66kZN3bBx8hq3xuTqEAe0xWzlSpQ40p7n4UZNPSluP9Ylx3SoINMjclibXUBFDVc4iaGTicFjybzhfVkDdFg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 233px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJH8RAvYBBlPmChic8ibY9q98WUeiaW7luLVuiacqBE5QT516Ea0z91FRxJjiahaQCzcGiazFic5FNXD6ZicpGNIoI6vGmMFzmgkjMSVib7E/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 317px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGtzagd1dCSzLibmBdBsjcQPicWQjocvJpt4n9ZkYcwdXXVpxtLyEk6KmcWibibyAJkShzRksc4iaHpKiank0AJOMgIYPTQCkpQAc0So/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 290px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJG1NE0eF8suxic81iabVlccjltia2688lRRibc6PrPusZU3fhCJHoYhsEQlNC08aJsxHVBl2wRalDNWggLvThHhGibbGKjMcDpiabol8/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 254px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFnarLXsDeMzuE46EuPnoFS1C9ss8dn6CMJFUp5of9Q10GfYeE0gQO54jOaQo4TyY0V65pGUSTicfxuD3SI2SicBtTqZdPkEszzM/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 246px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJED47jssXSEp4TjltLwGF3PTZRoDbSO3jl87PEyyvX66oRpqO3t3JK29y3KP06PcghWcCTZdVgBSOibzHfGjRoKGwGSUzBDPels/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 219px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHXMyCrXMPIFiaveibSSGYvibuGQiaXn78F6ttvDWWkicsdb4SVDtu2BUkOND71FdlcyzVs48QFpOq6OBQs2bs8xtqLAjnr7FzvOTP0/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 259px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFuyMFISTUI4uDeoibmTWiaL6ic7MQyrib0qvrFmsjtnat90f4MZddFHsDmibURliatM0eaQtF6cXiajCs5FibVVcuyADxvhW6qXsOsyok/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=7" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 316px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    激进的本儿会有公主抱，掐脖等互动，但也已经是极限了，这个商业模式去年就已经火了，后被多家媒体批判成低俗，并且添油加醋说什么这些店最后演变为提供有偿性服务，然后加上要抵制之类的话术，反正道德的高地先占上再说\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHRZl96XoEjW44qOicQibwVCXkOnnKJL1XRia0ju8XHE3lLLCHx0ollImVGEqLYsZo7UcBSMZydDm2x3NTvOIiaqqRfD4OIZwq4bPo/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=8" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 367px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGxE2qE0EX0TibzJmfKCJ4ZLFwfEhZnW0aVUAtDyOFHCGDUvHaQb4LyJYws5KTD4sPtxiaPibwe45VLfrzMic9WeFeaqQkhTU2SAJY/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=9" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 378px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但事实上，即使是在男色经济最发达的一线城市，其实都挺克制的，甚至有点雷声大雨点小的意思，而且在发车前，有大量的确认环节，也就是什么你能接受，什么不能接受，而且就算你接受，DM还不接受呢，条条框框很多\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而被媒体夸大升级为违法犯罪的，全是说我有个朋友，有个同学，然后怎么怎么样，经典桥断了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    素菜荤价\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但巫师也要辩证的看，比起那些标题党，我的视角是——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    素菜荤价\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    我们一层一层看\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    如果把恋陪和模子相比，那是纯纯\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    消费升级，品阶降级\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    一线城市的恋陪本的真实花销，也就是加上dm、场地，再加上当场的吃吃喝喝，就已经大几百的成本了，甚至还有很多千元以上的热门专场\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但这些成本反而是小头，大头有两大块\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    隐形成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    错位成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第一就是错位成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    很多消费者在选定一个本之后，选定了自己喜欢的dm之后，在参加这个本儿之前，会花大力气捯饬自己，这个捯饬可不是\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    画个全妆洗个头\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的等级，而是\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    服化道全上\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，比如自己花钱找人弄古偶的精致发型，加上相对应朝代的整套服装，当然也是为了自己出片，再有去买相关的道具，杂七杂八准备半天，这导致了一个很离谱的情况，就是消费者自己精心准备的造型下，一看照片，一时间分不清到底谁是玩家谁是恋陪DM，就是玩家比恋陪还精致，还高级，造成了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    到底谁在服务谁\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的这种【错位】\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    竞价\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    这还没完\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第二，就是这个市场已经衍生出了竞价和类似饭圈机制，对于个别比较帅且有名气的dm，大家得花费更多加钱去竞拍才能拿到他的档期，甚至有的商家很有创意的搞出了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    暗拍机制\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，然后被大家一顿吐槽，但这其实是典型的商业模式演化中必然会出现的市场化行为\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFBicQ4oeL77jZDPdd8Abib4diacDoJ1R87L9WkScgJFycPMdeiaemic59RohvkhD5GDwtHaAO0FIL64oEYerNHvQhWHa5R4v4HCuSk/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=10" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 493.75px !important; height: auto !important; background-color: transparent; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但这又还没完\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    打赏机制\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    随后出现了打赏机制，就是很多消费者，为了培养和自己欢喜的dm的感情，还要带上小礼物，这些礼物往往价值不菲，甚至还包括了奢侈品，同时在获得超预期的体验后，会在私下打赏，希望由此来“调校”DM的\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    正反馈心理\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，dm也乐得如此，由此更进一步，如果你给我送东西或者发红包，我就给你更牛逼的体验，更丰富的反馈\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但这又又又还没完，以上几个隐性成本虽然很吃经济，但这是有数的，相对可控的，巫师想说的最后一点，就是这个商业模式里面最不可控的一点了——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    上头成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    上头成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    不推演过程，直接给最终视角，曾爆出这样一张截图，大概是一个男dm炫耀自己干恋陪3个月，异性资源暴增\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    比当rapper更好的医美来了，没有恋陪本这些好事哪能轮到我\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEmejXjj2z65G0TKNibggNQrY4BiaicwJ9JibrYNnYBict7dqrj3JNOxicLM8rUM1e6viczDOAicibejud7miadQf08akcgicgYgZ4yyJEgibo/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=11" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    一张聊天记录的真实成分难以验证，只是反应出了该模式下更深的一层，就是消费者对dm上头之后，不但反复刷一个本，而且要和dm谈恋爱，这样的成本就不是几千块钱可以计量的了，最后爆出的各种瓜都是100%的BE\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    利益分配格局\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    这种模式改变了传统店家和DM的雇佣关系，现在更接近“MCN”或“夜场与公关”的合作模式。\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    平台方或者店方拿走门票收入的大头，男DM\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    底薪低，提成高\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    。甚至无底薪。这种形式下，头部效应极强，头部有名气的单明面上的收入就三五万一个月，私下打赏未知，而中腰部的收入断崖下降\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而以前还比较重要的剧本作者的地位又下降一档，话语权不断降低。因为剧情好坏和最最重要的【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    核诡\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】在这种模式下，不是刚需了，不再决定生死\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    近几年，类似于剧本杀密室女仆咖啡线下陪玩这些商业模式兴起，但在口罩时期和叠加线下经济的深度调整期，一半以上的剧本杀店已经倒闭，上海从顶峰2000多家下降到六七百家，巫师教你们一个词儿啊，就是你要说什么不行了，又怕敏感，你就说\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    行业繁荣度不及预期，供给侧进入深度调整期\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    从狼人杀店，桌游店变成了打本和密室，再到现在的恋陪，这背后，是传统的线下社交商业模式，偷偷靠向【男色经济】这种\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    盈利确定性更大，需求更刚性，利润溢价更高\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的商业模式，是整个行业供给者趋利避害的合理选择\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    男色消费变种\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    拍照搭子\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    如果说恋陪本还算是有中间商，那么很多人已经在平台上直接招贤纳士了，比如有人诚招帅哥来参加自己的毕业典礼，或者来拍毕业照\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    硬性要求是帅+身高183以上，不算鞋底不算头发的真实裸高，性取向不限，只要帅，需要帮忙送花，花钱雇主出，需要和雇主一块strong的从同学面前路过，从描述看是一位非常贴心的雇主了，但想必\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    对建模的要求极高\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，雇主也承认：本人阅帅哥无数，要求巨高，自认为“小帅”的被pass很正常，顶帅的话我花钱也会超大方的\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGj5vRCxhXejvicRv0Uaes8ynvy6bqsRJsbhicARgAhBuB6Jh4ic2ZbpxSoDibfm6mlrWxhw4Ticc7K3DicSy72B3khrvtbXVLibrr2vc/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=12" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 464px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    巫师本以为这是个例或者是在整活，但是经过研究发现，这个需求非常普遍，大量的帖子正在招贤纳士，大家的需求基本相似，价格在100-200元每小时不等，也就是如果忙乎四个小时的话，能收大几百块的报酬，雇员一般情况下提供全套“仪式感”。除了拍照，还负责提供情绪价值，当然还有当天的拿包拿衣服等助理类的琐碎工作\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHSZ9bK0aTUia1KMM3TkzWM4Cwkedib9WPriaXNVViaMPWG5qZgJXSm7byFvUZZXL5azMssSrjTvPFlgibL2hfUtqxJ6kOFAQR2JL90/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=13" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    然而这背后是一个巨大的市场，巫师说的不是毕业照，而是大家在平台上通过各种形式直接发帖雇佣小帅，另一种形式的Boss直聘了，这是典型的【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    平台经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】的雏形，只是现在还没有一个类似于【滴滴】之于出行需求的，能够完全收拢这种需求的单一平台\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    这种需求里面有各种花里胡哨的形式，但内核相似\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    拼好抱\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第一，"拼好抱"服务\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    就是付费寻找帅哥来一场拥抱。抱完各回各家。此帖迅速引发共鸣，之后大量用户形成效仿\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    还有人发布“抱后感”\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    搭子经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第二，搭子经济，搭子经济本质还是地陪的一种变种，但最主要的区别是，必须要帅，要高，做一天有偿的搭子，内容包含但不限于吃饭，看电影，唱k，游乐场、动物园、水族馆、骑行、室内运动、滑雪、逛公园，爬山等等等，更激进一点的要求对方提供暧昧氛围，但谢绝更进一步的肢体接触\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    相似的形式下，还有个壳，叫——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    陪拍师服务\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    "陪拍"师除了为客户提供拍照和修片服务，还可陪同逛街、游览景点，就像花钱请了一位能拍会玩的伴侣，当然，雇主需要的是一个帅哥伴侣而且要实时提供情绪价值和照顾，在对帅的要求下，对于拍照设备的要求反而放在了第二位，长枪短炮的设备装逼流在【帅】面前，瞬间显得一文不值\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEYicw5icy2cO6mxzvq4m5EBR9CanXZfWNk0wJueINUaT7lNV2Gichxw9LraXic6KonnU7g9GS3cGibPBUzKMR3FuKm2kgPZlzUxRYA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=14" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    无论是陪游，陪拍，一日搭子，或者一日男友等等服务，价格均在100-200元每小时，\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而在供给侧，有男生表示，自从做地陪后已经50次进出北京环球影城，一周内曾连续5天入园，熟悉到年卡通道的员工都认识他。为了提高服务品质，不少主打颜值的地陪，反而购置了专业补光套装、无人机等装备，也有人研究总结了很多景点“免排队”或逃票小窍门以此作为吸引顾客的噱头。当然，私下接单也存在诚信风险：对方临时爽约或“逃单”行为非常普遍\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    有博主分享自己雇佣“男大生地陪”的经历：先在社媒上筛选“男大”陪游的帖子，他们通常详细列出自己的服务信息：价格、年龄、身高体重、熟悉的景点、最重要的是大量的自拍展示面，经过最近一段时间的竞争，供给侧也是\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    卷起来了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    他会帮你设计行程攻略、购票安排，全程陪伴讲解，摄影甚至还附赠修图，热情聊天、夸夸不断，还有的自备交通工具，相当有服务意识\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    景区帅哥NPC\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第三，从2021年起，很多景区就开始批量雇佣"帅哥NPC"和“肌肉NPC”，这成为景区营销的新名片。从最开始的噱头，再到可以给游客提供简单合影，再到现在的百花齐放，很多景区已升级互动形式，牵手、拥抱、贴脸杀，借位接吻和喂棒棒糖等互动在社交媒体上爆火，很多景区也由此在短时间内获得大量流量，带动了当地的经济，当然自然又有一批媒体站在道德高地上一顿批判，说低俗什么的，虽然这些形式突破传统界限，但本质上还是逢场作戏，内核其实还是很克制，没有私下交易，男模本质还是商品属性，风险相较于前几种形式反而更加可控\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    集大成者\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    如果我们再把标准放宽，其实还有更多男色经济的场景正在冉冉升起\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    比如主打帅哥和肌肉男服务的【猛男餐厅】，对标的是以前的女仆餐厅\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再比如用帅哥引流的二次元酒吧或者执事咖啡馆\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再比如视频平台的各形式的团播，尤其是男团的团播\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHfUpXpTR9MZuxiaiaXU4sqDld7YRI7LhzicsB898BAhiaAzUzjgtVoaR99eR6eM4PCia6eswDgJHB8nSyibke8Hatj1E5eQWULbDJm4/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=15" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    以及男主播，"男模日记"赛道等等，以及后续衍生的消费，帅哥陪打游戏、语音陪伴、哄睡服务等等，当然重点还是帅，更重要的是声音好听\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    线上另一块比较大的就是女性向纸片人，比如沉浸式乙女游戏赛道下的国乙四大天王，以及不那么注重恋爱的群像养成游戏，主打陪伴、多角色\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再小众一点，就是女频图文消费，其中耽美赛道的粘性和客单价尤为优秀，这个赛道真的很有意思，研究半天写了一堆，但最后巫师还是把这段删了（心疼），想了想，还是不要被大众注意的好，不要回复，不要回复\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但如果我们穿透这些细碎复杂的商业模式，男色经济中最最最集大成者是什么，又回到咱们的领域了，\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    偶像经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    男偶像唯一提供的价值就是【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    性魅力\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】，这个理论巫师说了无数遍，别跟我犟嘴说什么演技唱功内核，偶像经济之所以称之为“集大成者”，表层是他们的覆盖人群规模最庞大，营收和利润比以上所有赛道加起来还要再加两个0，但巫师不想列数据\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    真正的牛逼之处在于水下，资本创造了一个“\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    负熵\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ”的商业奇迹： 它让一群本该是“上帝”的消费者，心甘情愿地成为了自带干粮、甚至倒贴钱的工具人\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    消费者付了钱，不但没被服务，反而要去劳动\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    "消费"包装成了"爱"，"被剥削"包装成"养成"，刷数据冲销量包装成了"战斗"，并且通过饭圈这个形式内部互相监督，形成压力闭环，消费者自己成了监工，监督其他消费者为资本劳动\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGSwcCVV1fcyfL2Ql48jdw759uqB20qYuibxfwsozKth7bG1p76xr2HvnAuhibTfVX9d7vcR6icg9O170xPGOwlrykmch0sGJ4QoU/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=16" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHVxw9GoKgmmic1ia7CicIyxhBuqXfiact0yks1SNBJShGBbn4VhgVFs3icB53gWoExNGO7ESrYWiclppa7qPMbXdl4kp24uNlCtC4nc/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=17" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    你是否还记得那句经典的——他只有我们了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    当然，偶像经济能达到如此大的规模自然有其合理性，巫师的明星与资本系列已经深度分析多次，巫师在投行职业生涯中把影视行业视为鄙视链最底层，幺蛾子多、引人注目，还都是小项目，烂项目，，只是这么多年明星与资本系列衍生出的无数暴论，你们可以当成商业思维启发的药引\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    男色经济的内核\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    跳出商业本身，我们拉到上帝视角\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    中国经济正在处于深度调整期，消费数据的趋势明显，背后是人们在“消费降级”和“理性回归”中不断探索\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJH9yKZBTFjY4YG14joiac4zibbcIuzscTuTzWzEPNO24P2Nh1ibsbkvgz86z8ImFD9jjbicgz0xA8n5adpeug9T8UUJmppiaBzic2u60/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=18" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    然而我们又势必要刺激内需拉动消费，下一个增长点，或许不一定非要在【物质消费】这个范围中寻找\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    截止2024，中国一人户家庭，占比接近1/5，这包含了全年龄段的独居者\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEp4FOwfubpvE7SLicdMn3U9TInRe2TZ3wHO6ULoRgP3NfibJWFJ7Iia6JiakyEUMib28ls2K16dQNLeWfHsBd9D5ucufrBkvy9TjdA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=19" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    同时，中国平均初婚年龄自2016年起快速提高，五年前的官方数据就已经接近30岁\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEymM4AgvD41XTtF2IC4L2rz64v0wUicOhfuVjiaiasrTibQRACdxjUZIHNicGWicpMofxF2qXf4ojYjv6T8xxIQmn5s191Myash2tOg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=20" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再有，工作节奏极限压缩社交机会，表面上每天都要应付很多人，但实际有效社交几乎为0的【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    新孤独态\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】成为打工人的常态\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    其实很早就有人向精神消费和情绪消费探索，但是之前很多所谓的精神消费，巫师看来可以归为两类\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第一类是：没事儿找事儿\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第二类是：脱了裤子放屁\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    然后都加上巨高的溢价，最后都沦为智商税筛选的笑柄\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    大家可以把你认为的符合这两类的消费打在公屏上\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而任何一个正在野蛮发展的赛道，往往说明这个需求来自本源，是真实存在的而不是吹出来的，这个赛道虽然听上去有点上不了台面，但其内核要相对温和的多\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    我们对比“男色经济”与“女色经济”的根本区别——即男性消费女色，中间披上了各种形式的外衣，但本质都是为了一个事儿，每个人都知道我在说什么，所以女色经济，其实\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    非常单一、且风险极高，往往处于灰色甚至黑色区域\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，而这些区域也成为灰黑产重要的引流池子\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而男色经济则正好相反，也就是女性可不是为了所谓的最后一步，而是指向\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    多维度的情感体验过程\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，这种多层次的需求，意味着商家可以创造出无数种不同的商品和服务SKU，从而形成一条长长的产业链，在每个环节都能产生溢价和GDP\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    男性是要结果\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    女性是要过程\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    上述的各种男色经济的形式，就是这条长长的，注重过程的需求中，创造的细分商业模式，这种\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    非线性、弥散状\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的需求，创造了比单纯的生理交易大得多的市场空间\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而【注重过程】这一重大区别，带来了另一大商业模式上的优势，就是“安全”与“温和，更不易涉及法律法规红线，从而让各种男色经济获得了在公域传播的合法性+合理性，甚至在需求不断释放，市场不断规范下，衍生为真正的平台经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    同时创造出\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    非体力的灵活就业\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    虽然现在部分商业模式还存在隐患，但很多新兴行业都经历过"\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    野蛮生长—乱象频发—监管和媒体监督介入—行业洗牌—规范化\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    "的周期\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    Ok。本期观点、文案、图表点个关注自取随便用，就说是你写的\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-bottom: 0px;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    资本永不眠，下期见\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style="display: none;">\n <mp-style-type data-value="3">\n </mp-style-type>\n</p>', 1, 1, '<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    大家好我是巫师，来不及悼念物质消费的降级了，接下来登场的是：精神消费的升级——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    男色经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    说的不是工体三里屯夜店的无效social和模子消费，这些都是老登的土旧模式，消费升级伴随着的是形式革新，举个例子——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    恋陪本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; visibility: visible;">\n    恋陪模式\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; visibility: visible;">\n    故事or感情\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    传统剧本杀是体验一段故事，而恋陪本是体验一段感情\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    其核心资产是高颜值的男性DM（主持人）。也有店面将他们称为“男执”或“卡司”\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); visibility: visible;">\n    剧情中常常包含拥抱，牵手、摸脸、十指相扣，靠肩膀，摸头，近距离对视、求婚和结婚、生离死别等场景\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFyaV11picWvjGyQUm66kZN3bBx8hq3xuTqEAe0xWzlSpQ40p7n4UZNPSluP9Ylx3SoINMjclibXUBFDVc4iaGTicFjybzhfVkDdFg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 233px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJH8RAvYBBlPmChic8ibY9q98WUeiaW7luLVuiacqBE5QT516Ea0z91FRxJjiahaQCzcGiazFic5FNXD6ZicpGNIoI6vGmMFzmgkjMSVib7E/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 317px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGtzagd1dCSzLibmBdBsjcQPicWQjocvJpt4n9ZkYcwdXXVpxtLyEk6KmcWibibyAJkShzRksc4iaHpKiank0AJOMgIYPTQCkpQAc0So/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 290px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px; visibility: visible;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block; text-indent: 0px; visibility: visible;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJG1NE0eF8suxic81iabVlccjltia2688lRRibc6PrPusZU3fhCJHoYhsEQlNC08aJsxHVBl2wRalDNWggLvThHhGibbGKjMcDpiabol8/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 254px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFnarLXsDeMzuE46EuPnoFS1C9ss8dn6CMJFUp5of9Q10GfYeE0gQO54jOaQo4TyY0V65pGUSTicfxuD3SI2SicBtTqZdPkEszzM/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 246px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJED47jssXSEp4TjltLwGF3PTZRoDbSO3jl87PEyyvX66oRpqO3t3JK29y3KP06PcghWcCTZdVgBSOibzHfGjRoKGwGSUzBDPels/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 219px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHXMyCrXMPIFiaveibSSGYvibuGQiaXn78F6ttvDWWkicsdb4SVDtu2BUkOND71FdlcyzVs48QFpOq6OBQs2bs8xtqLAjnr7FzvOTP0/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 259px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFuyMFISTUI4uDeoibmTWiaL6ic7MQyrib0qvrFmsjtnat90f4MZddFHsDmibURliatM0eaQtF6cXiajCs5FibVVcuyADxvhW6qXsOsyok/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=7" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 316px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    激进的本儿会有公主抱，掐脖等互动，但也已经是极限了，这个商业模式去年就已经火了，后被多家媒体批判成低俗，并且添油加醋说什么这些店最后演变为提供有偿性服务，然后加上要抵制之类的话术，反正道德的高地先占上再说\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHRZl96XoEjW44qOicQibwVCXkOnnKJL1XRia0ju8XHE3lLLCHx0ollImVGEqLYsZo7UcBSMZydDm2x3NTvOIiaqqRfD4OIZwq4bPo/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=8" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 367px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGxE2qE0EX0TibzJmfKCJ4ZLFwfEhZnW0aVUAtDyOFHCGDUvHaQb4LyJYws5KTD4sPtxiaPibwe45VLfrzMic9WeFeaqQkhTU2SAJY/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=9" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 378px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但事实上，即使是在男色经济最发达的一线城市，其实都挺克制的，甚至有点雷声大雨点小的意思，而且在发车前，有大量的确认环节，也就是什么你能接受，什么不能接受，而且就算你接受，DM还不接受呢，条条框框很多\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而被媒体夸大升级为违法犯罪的，全是说我有个朋友，有个同学，然后怎么怎么样，经典桥断了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    素菜荤价\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但巫师也要辩证的看，比起那些标题党，我的视角是——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    素菜荤价\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    我们一层一层看\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    如果把恋陪和模子相比，那是纯纯\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    消费升级，品阶降级\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    一线城市的恋陪本的真实花销，也就是加上dm、场地，再加上当场的吃吃喝喝，就已经大几百的成本了，甚至还有很多千元以上的热门专场\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但这些成本反而是小头，大头有两大块\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    隐形成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    错位成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第一就是错位成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    很多消费者在选定一个本之后，选定了自己喜欢的dm之后，在参加这个本儿之前，会花大力气捯饬自己，这个捯饬可不是\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    画个全妆洗个头\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的等级，而是\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    服化道全上\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，比如自己花钱找人弄古偶的精致发型，加上相对应朝代的整套服装，当然也是为了自己出片，再有去买相关的道具，杂七杂八准备半天，这导致了一个很离谱的情况，就是消费者自己精心准备的造型下，一看照片，一时间分不清到底谁是玩家谁是恋陪DM，就是玩家比恋陪还精致，还高级，造成了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    到底谁在服务谁\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的这种【错位】\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    竞价\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    这还没完\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第二，就是这个市场已经衍生出了竞价和类似饭圈机制，对于个别比较帅且有名气的dm，大家得花费更多加钱去竞拍才能拿到他的档期，甚至有的商家很有创意的搞出了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    暗拍机制\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，然后被大家一顿吐槽，但这其实是典型的商业模式演化中必然会出现的市场化行为\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFBicQ4oeL77jZDPdd8Abib4diacDoJ1R87L9WkScgJFycPMdeiaemic59RohvkhD5GDwtHaAO0FIL64oEYerNHvQhWHa5R4v4HCuSk/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=10" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 493.75px !important; height: auto !important; background-color: transparent; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但这又还没完\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    打赏机制\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    随后出现了打赏机制，就是很多消费者，为了培养和自己欢喜的dm的感情，还要带上小礼物，这些礼物往往价值不菲，甚至还包括了奢侈品，同时在获得超预期的体验后，会在私下打赏，希望由此来“调校”DM的\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    正反馈心理\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，dm也乐得如此，由此更进一步，如果你给我送东西或者发红包，我就给你更牛逼的体验，更丰富的反馈\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但这又又又还没完，以上几个隐性成本虽然很吃经济，但这是有数的，相对可控的，巫师想说的最后一点，就是这个商业模式里面最不可控的一点了——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    上头成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    上头成本\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    不推演过程，直接给最终视角，曾爆出这样一张截图，大概是一个男dm炫耀自己干恋陪3个月，异性资源暴增\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    比当rapper更好的医美来了，没有恋陪本这些好事哪能轮到我\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEmejXjj2z65G0TKNibggNQrY4BiaicwJ9JibrYNnYBict7dqrj3JNOxicLM8rUM1e6viczDOAicibejud7miadQf08akcgicgYgZ4yyJEgibo/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=11" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    一张聊天记录的真实成分难以验证，只是反应出了该模式下更深的一层，就是消费者对dm上头之后，不但反复刷一个本，而且要和dm谈恋爱，这样的成本就不是几千块钱可以计量的了，最后爆出的各种瓜都是100%的BE\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    利益分配格局\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    这种模式改变了传统店家和DM的雇佣关系，现在更接近“MCN”或“夜场与公关”的合作模式。\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    平台方或者店方拿走门票收入的大头，男DM\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    底薪低，提成高\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    。甚至无底薪。这种形式下，头部效应极强，头部有名气的单明面上的收入就三五万一个月，私下打赏未知，而中腰部的收入断崖下降\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而以前还比较重要的剧本作者的地位又下降一档，话语权不断降低。因为剧情好坏和最最重要的【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    核诡\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】在这种模式下，不是刚需了，不再决定生死\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    近几年，类似于剧本杀密室女仆咖啡线下陪玩这些商业模式兴起，但在口罩时期和叠加线下经济的深度调整期，一半以上的剧本杀店已经倒闭，上海从顶峰2000多家下降到六七百家，巫师教你们一个词儿啊，就是你要说什么不行了，又怕敏感，你就说\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    行业繁荣度不及预期，供给侧进入深度调整期\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    从狼人杀店，桌游店变成了打本和密室，再到现在的恋陪，这背后，是传统的线下社交商业模式，偷偷靠向【男色经济】这种\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    盈利确定性更大，需求更刚性，利润溢价更高\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的商业模式，是整个行业供给者趋利避害的合理选择\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    男色消费变种\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    拍照搭子\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    如果说恋陪本还算是有中间商，那么很多人已经在平台上直接招贤纳士了，比如有人诚招帅哥来参加自己的毕业典礼，或者来拍毕业照\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    硬性要求是帅+身高183以上，不算鞋底不算头发的真实裸高，性取向不限，只要帅，需要帮忙送花，花钱雇主出，需要和雇主一块strong的从同学面前路过，从描述看是一位非常贴心的雇主了，但想必\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    对建模的要求极高\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，雇主也承认：本人阅帅哥无数，要求巨高，自认为“小帅”的被pass很正常，顶帅的话我花钱也会超大方的\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGj5vRCxhXejvicRv0Uaes8ynvy6bqsRJsbhicARgAhBuB6Jh4ic2ZbpxSoDibfm6mlrWxhw4Ticc7K3DicSy72B3khrvtbXVLibrr2vc/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=12" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 464px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    巫师本以为这是个例或者是在整活，但是经过研究发现，这个需求非常普遍，大量的帖子正在招贤纳士，大家的需求基本相似，价格在100-200元每小时不等，也就是如果忙乎四个小时的话，能收大几百块的报酬，雇员一般情况下提供全套“仪式感”。除了拍照，还负责提供情绪价值，当然还有当天的拿包拿衣服等助理类的琐碎工作\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHSZ9bK0aTUia1KMM3TkzWM4Cwkedib9WPriaXNVViaMPWG5qZgJXSm7byFvUZZXL5azMssSrjTvPFlgibL2hfUtqxJ6kOFAQR2JL90/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=13" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    然而这背后是一个巨大的市场，巫师说的不是毕业照，而是大家在平台上通过各种形式直接发帖雇佣小帅，另一种形式的Boss直聘了，这是典型的【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    平台经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】的雏形，只是现在还没有一个类似于【滴滴】之于出行需求的，能够完全收拢这种需求的单一平台\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    这种需求里面有各种花里胡哨的形式，但内核相似\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    拼好抱\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第一，"拼好抱"服务\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    就是付费寻找帅哥来一场拥抱。抱完各回各家。此帖迅速引发共鸣，之后大量用户形成效仿\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    还有人发布“抱后感”\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    搭子经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第二，搭子经济，搭子经济本质还是地陪的一种变种，但最主要的区别是，必须要帅，要高，做一天有偿的搭子，内容包含但不限于吃饭，看电影，唱k，游乐场、动物园、水族馆、骑行、室内运动、滑雪、逛公园，爬山等等等，更激进一点的要求对方提供暧昧氛围，但谢绝更进一步的肢体接触\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    相似的形式下，还有个壳，叫——\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    陪拍师服务\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    "陪拍"师除了为客户提供拍照和修片服务，还可陪同逛街、游览景点，就像花钱请了一位能拍会玩的伴侣，当然，雇主需要的是一个帅哥伴侣而且要实时提供情绪价值和照顾，在对帅的要求下，对于拍照设备的要求反而放在了第二位，长枪短炮的设备装逼流在【帅】面前，瞬间显得一文不值\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEYicw5icy2cO6mxzvq4m5EBR9CanXZfWNk0wJueINUaT7lNV2Gichxw9LraXic6KonnU7g9GS3cGibPBUzKMR3FuKm2kgPZlzUxRYA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=14" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    无论是陪游，陪拍，一日搭子，或者一日男友等等服务，价格均在100-200元每小时，\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而在供给侧，有男生表示，自从做地陪后已经50次进出北京环球影城，一周内曾连续5天入园，熟悉到年卡通道的员工都认识他。为了提高服务品质，不少主打颜值的地陪，反而购置了专业补光套装、无人机等装备，也有人研究总结了很多景点“免排队”或逃票小窍门以此作为吸引顾客的噱头。当然，私下接单也存在诚信风险：对方临时爽约或“逃单”行为非常普遍\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    有博主分享自己雇佣“男大生地陪”的经历：先在社媒上筛选“男大”陪游的帖子，他们通常详细列出自己的服务信息：价格、年龄、身高体重、熟悉的景点、最重要的是大量的自拍展示面，经过最近一段时间的竞争，供给侧也是\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    卷起来了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    他会帮你设计行程攻略、购票安排，全程陪伴讲解，摄影甚至还附赠修图，热情聊天、夸夸不断，还有的自备交通工具，相当有服务意识\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 18.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    景区帅哥NPC\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第三，从2021年起，很多景区就开始批量雇佣"帅哥NPC"和“肌肉NPC”，这成为景区营销的新名片。从最开始的噱头，再到可以给游客提供简单合影，再到现在的百花齐放，很多景区已升级互动形式，牵手、拥抱、贴脸杀，借位接吻和喂棒棒糖等互动在社交媒体上爆火，很多景区也由此在短时间内获得大量流量，带动了当地的经济，当然自然又有一批媒体站在道德高地上一顿批判，说低俗什么的，虽然这些形式突破传统界限，但本质上还是逢场作戏，内核其实还是很克制，没有私下交易，男模本质还是商品属性，风险相较于前几种形式反而更加可控\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    集大成者\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    如果我们再把标准放宽，其实还有更多男色经济的场景正在冉冉升起\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    比如主打帅哥和肌肉男服务的【猛男餐厅】，对标的是以前的女仆餐厅\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再比如用帅哥引流的二次元酒吧或者执事咖啡馆\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再比如视频平台的各形式的团播，尤其是男团的团播\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHfUpXpTR9MZuxiaiaXU4sqDld7YRI7LhzicsB898BAhiaAzUzjgtVoaR99eR6eM4PCia6eswDgJHB8nSyibke8Hatj1E5eQWULbDJm4/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=15" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    以及男主播，"男模日记"赛道等等，以及后续衍生的消费，帅哥陪打游戏、语音陪伴、哄睡服务等等，当然重点还是帅，更重要的是声音好听\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    线上另一块比较大的就是女性向纸片人，比如沉浸式乙女游戏赛道下的国乙四大天王，以及不那么注重恋爱的群像养成游戏，主打陪伴、多角色\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再小众一点，就是女频图文消费，其中耽美赛道的粘性和客单价尤为优秀，这个赛道真的很有意思，研究半天写了一堆，但最后巫师还是把这段删了（心疼），想了想，还是不要被大众注意的好，不要回复，不要回复\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    但如果我们穿透这些细碎复杂的商业模式，男色经济中最最最集大成者是什么，又回到咱们的领域了，\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    偶像经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    男偶像唯一提供的价值就是【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    性魅力\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】，这个理论巫师说了无数遍，别跟我犟嘴说什么演技唱功内核，偶像经济之所以称之为“集大成者”，表层是他们的覆盖人群规模最庞大，营收和利润比以上所有赛道加起来还要再加两个0，但巫师不想列数据\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    真正的牛逼之处在于水下，资本创造了一个“\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    负熵\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ”的商业奇迹： 它让一群本该是“上帝”的消费者，心甘情愿地成为了自带干粮、甚至倒贴钱的工具人\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    消费者付了钱，不但没被服务，反而要去劳动\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    "消费"包装成了"爱"，"被剥削"包装成"养成"，刷数据冲销量包装成了"战斗"，并且通过饭圈这个形式内部互相监督，形成压力闭环，消费者自己成了监工，监督其他消费者为资本劳动\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGSwcCVV1fcyfL2Ql48jdw759uqB20qYuibxfwsozKth7bG1p76xr2HvnAuhibTfVX9d7vcR6icg9O170xPGOwlrykmch0sGJ4QoU/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=16" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHVxw9GoKgmmic1ia7CicIyxhBuqXfiact0yks1SNBJShGBbn4VhgVFs3icB53gWoExNGO7ESrYWiclppa7qPMbXdl4kp24uNlCtC4nc/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=17" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    你是否还记得那句经典的——他只有我们了\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    当然，偶像经济能达到如此大的规模自然有其合理性，巫师的明星与资本系列已经深度分析多次，巫师在投行职业生涯中把影视行业视为鄙视链最底层，幺蛾子多、引人注目，还都是小项目，烂项目，，只是这么多年明星与资本系列衍生出的无数暴论，你们可以当成商业思维启发的药引\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight: bold;">\n    男色经济的内核\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    跳出商业本身，我们拉到上帝视角\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    中国经济正在处于深度调整期，消费数据的趋势明显，背后是人们在“消费降级”和“理性回归”中不断探索\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJH9yKZBTFjY4YG14joiac4zibbcIuzscTuTzWzEPNO24P2Nh1ibsbkvgz86z8ImFD9jjbicgz0xA8n5adpeug9T8UUJmppiaBzic2u60/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=18" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    然而我们又势必要刺激内需拉动消费，下一个增长点，或许不一定非要在【物质消费】这个范围中寻找\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    截止2024，中国一人户家庭，占比接近1/5，这包含了全年龄段的独居者\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEp4FOwfubpvE7SLicdMn3U9TInRe2TZ3wHO6ULoRgP3NfibJWFJ7Iia6JiakyEUMib28ls2K16dQNLeWfHsBd9D5ucufrBkvy9TjdA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=19" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    同时，中国平均初婚年龄自2016年起快速提高，五年前的官方数据就已经接近30岁\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEymM4AgvD41XTtF2IC4L2rz64v0wUicOhfuVjiaiasrTibQRACdxjUZIHNicGWicpMofxF2qXf4ojYjv6T8xxIQmn5s191Myash2tOg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=20" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 680px !important; background-color: transparent; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    再有，工作节奏极限压缩社交机会，表面上每天都要应付很多人，但实际有效社交几乎为0的【\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    新孤独态\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    】成为打工人的常态\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    其实很早就有人向精神消费和情绪消费探索，但是之前很多所谓的精神消费，巫师看来可以归为两类\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第一类是：没事儿找事儿\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    第二类是：脱了裤子放屁\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    然后都加上巨高的溢价，最后都沦为智商税筛选的笑柄\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    大家可以把你认为的符合这两类的消费打在公屏上\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而任何一个正在野蛮发展的赛道，往往说明这个需求来自本源，是真实存在的而不是吹出来的，这个赛道虽然听上去有点上不了台面，但其内核要相对温和的多\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    我们对比“男色经济”与“女色经济”的根本区别——即男性消费女色，中间披上了各种形式的外衣，但本质都是为了一个事儿，每个人都知道我在说什么，所以女色经济，其实\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    非常单一、且风险极高，往往处于灰色甚至黑色区域\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，而这些区域也成为灰黑产重要的引流池子\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而男色经济则正好相反，也就是女性可不是为了所谓的最后一步，而是指向\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    多维度的情感体验过程\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    ，这种多层次的需求，意味着商家可以创造出无数种不同的商品和服务SKU，从而形成一条长长的产业链，在每个环节都能产生溢价和GDP\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    男性是要结果\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    女性是要过程\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    上述的各种男色经济的形式，就是这条长长的，注重过程的需求中，创造的细分商业模式，这种\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    非线性、弥散状\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    的需求，创造了比单纯的生理交易大得多的市场空间\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    而【注重过程】这一重大区别，带来了另一大商业模式上的优势，就是“安全”与“温和，更不易涉及法律法规红线，从而让各种男色经济获得了在公域传播的合法性+合理性，甚至在需求不断释放，市场不断规范下，衍生为真正的平台经济\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    同时创造出\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    非体力的灵活就业\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    虽然现在部分商业模式还存在隐患，但很多新兴行业都经历过"\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    野蛮生长—乱象频发—监管和媒体监督介入—行业洗牌—规范化\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    "的周期\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    Ok。本期观点、文案、图表点个关注自取随便用，就说是你写的\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-bottom: 0px;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">\n    资本永不眠，下期见\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style="display: none;">\n <mp-style-type data-value="3">\n </mp-style-type>\n</p>', '<p>大家好我是巫师，来不及悼念物质消费的降级了，接下来登场的是：精神消费的升级——\n男色经济</p>\n<p>说的不是工体三里屯夜店的无效social和模子消费，这些都是老登的土旧模式，消费升级伴随着的是形式革新，举个例子——\n恋陪本</p>\n<p>恋陪模式</p>\n<p>故事or感情</p>\n<p>传统剧本杀是体验一段故事，而恋陪本是体验一段感情</p>\n<p>其核心资产是高颜值的男性DM（主持人）。也有店面将他们称为“男执”或“卡司”</p>\n<p>剧情中常常包含拥抱，牵手、摸脸、十指相扣，靠肩膀，摸头，近距离对视、求婚和结婚、生离死别等场景</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFyaV11picWvjGyQUm66kZN3bBx8hq3xuTqEAe0xWzlSpQ40p7n4UZNPSluP9Ylx3SoINMjclibXUBFDVc4iaGTicFjybzhfVkDdFg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJH8RAvYBBlPmChic8ibY9q98WUeiaW7luLVuiacqBE5QT516Ea0z91FRxJjiahaQCzcGiazFic5FNXD6ZicpGNIoI6vGmMFzmgkjMSVib7E/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGtzagd1dCSzLibmBdBsjcQPicWQjocvJpt4n9ZkYcwdXXVpxtLyEk6KmcWibibyAJkShzRksc4iaHpKiank0AJOMgIYPTQCkpQAc0So/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJG1NE0eF8suxic81iabVlccjltia2688lRRibc6PrPusZU3fhCJHoYhsEQlNC08aJsxHVBl2wRalDNWggLvThHhGibbGKjMcDpiabol8/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFnarLXsDeMzuE46EuPnoFS1C9ss8dn6CMJFUp5of9Q10GfYeE0gQO54jOaQo4TyY0V65pGUSTicfxuD3SI2SicBtTqZdPkEszzM/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJED47jssXSEp4TjltLwGF3PTZRoDbSO3jl87PEyyvX66oRpqO3t3JK29y3KP06PcghWcCTZdVgBSOibzHfGjRoKGwGSUzBDPels/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHXMyCrXMPIFiaveibSSGYvibuGQiaXn78F6ttvDWWkicsdb4SVDtu2BUkOND71FdlcyzVs48QFpOq6OBQs2bs8xtqLAjnr7FzvOTP0/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFuyMFISTUI4uDeoibmTWiaL6ic7MQyrib0qvrFmsjtnat90f4MZddFHsDmibURliatM0eaQtF6cXiajCs5FibVVcuyADxvhW6qXsOsyok/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=7"/></p>\n<p>激进的本儿会有公主抱，掐脖等互动，但也已经是极限了，这个商业模式去年就已经火了，后被多家媒体批判成低俗，并且添油加醋说什么这些店最后演变为提供有偿性服务，然后加上要抵制之类的话术，反正道德的高地先占上再说</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHRZl96XoEjW44qOicQibwVCXkOnnKJL1XRia0ju8XHE3lLLCHx0ollImVGEqLYsZo7UcBSMZydDm2x3NTvOIiaqqRfD4OIZwq4bPo/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=8"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGxE2qE0EX0TibzJmfKCJ4ZLFwfEhZnW0aVUAtDyOFHCGDUvHaQb4LyJYws5KTD4sPtxiaPibwe45VLfrzMic9WeFeaqQkhTU2SAJY/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=9"/></p>\n<p>但事实上，即使是在男色经济最发达的一线城市，其实都挺克制的，甚至有点雷声大雨点小的意思，而且在发车前，有大量的确认环节，也就是什么你能接受，什么不能接受，而且就算你接受，DM还不接受呢，条条框框很多</p>\n<p>而被媒体夸大升级为违法犯罪的，全是说我有个朋友，有个同学，然后怎么怎么样，经典桥断了</p>\n<p>素菜荤价</p>\n<p>但巫师也要辩证的看，比起那些标题党，我的视角是——\n素菜荤价</p>\n<p>我们一层一层看</p>\n<p>如果把恋陪和模子相比，那是纯纯\n消费升级，品阶降级</p>\n<p>一线城市的恋陪本的真实花销，也就是加上dm、场地，再加上当场的吃吃喝喝，就已经大几百的成本了，甚至还有很多千元以上的热门专场</p>\n<p>但这些成本反而是小头，大头有两大块</p>\n<p>隐形成本</p>\n<p>错位成本</p>\n<p>第一就是错位成本</p>\n<p>很多消费者在选定一个本之后，选定了自己喜欢的dm之后，在参加这个本儿之前，会花大力气捯饬自己，这个捯饬可不是\n画个全妆洗个头\n的等级，而是\n服化道全上\n，比如自己花钱找人弄古偶的精致发型，加上相对应朝代的整套服装，当然也是为了自己出片，再有去买相关的道具，杂七杂八准备半天，这导致了一个很离谱的情况，就是消费者自己精心准备的造型下，一看照片，一时间分不清到底谁是玩家谁是恋陪DM，就是玩家比恋陪还精致，还高级，造成了\n到底谁在服务谁\n的这种【错位】</p>\n<p>竞价</p>\n<p>这还没完</p>\n<p>第二，就是这个市场已经衍生出了竞价和类似饭圈机制，对于个别比较帅且有名气的dm，大家得花费更多加钱去竞拍才能拿到他的档期，甚至有的商家很有创意的搞出了\n暗拍机制\n，然后被大家一顿吐槽，但这其实是典型的商业模式演化中必然会出现的市场化行为</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFBicQ4oeL77jZDPdd8Abib4diacDoJ1R87L9WkScgJFycPMdeiaemic59RohvkhD5GDwtHaAO0FIL64oEYerNHvQhWHa5R4v4HCuSk/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=10"/></p>\n<p>但这又还没完</p>\n<p>打赏机制</p>\n<p>随后出现了打赏机制，就是很多消费者，为了培养和自己欢喜的dm的感情，还要带上小礼物，这些礼物往往价值不菲，甚至还包括了奢侈品，同时在获得超预期的体验后，会在私下打赏，希望由此来“调校”DM的\n正反馈心理\n，dm也乐得如此，由此更进一步，如果你给我送东西或者发红包，我就给你更牛逼的体验，更丰富的反馈</p>\n<p>但这又又又还没完，以上几个隐性成本虽然很吃经济，但这是有数的，相对可控的，巫师想说的最后一点，就是这个商业模式里面最不可控的一点了——\n上头成本</p>\n<p>上头成本</p>\n<p>不推演过程，直接给最终视角，曾爆出这样一张截图，大概是一个男dm炫耀自己干恋陪3个月，异性资源暴增</p>\n<p>比当rapper更好的医美来了，没有恋陪本这些好事哪能轮到我</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEmejXjj2z65G0TKNibggNQrY4BiaicwJ9JibrYNnYBict7dqrj3JNOxicLM8rUM1e6viczDOAicibejud7miadQf08akcgicgYgZ4yyJEgibo/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=11"/></p>\n<p>一张聊天记录的真实成分难以验证，只是反应出了该模式下更深的一层，就是消费者对dm上头之后，不但反复刷一个本，而且要和dm谈恋爱，这样的成本就不是几千块钱可以计量的了，最后爆出的各种瓜都是100%的BE</p>\n<p>利益分配格局</p>\n<p>这种模式改变了传统店家和DM的雇佣关系，现在更接近“MCN”或“夜场与公关”的合作模式。</p>\n<p>平台方或者店方拿走门票收入的大头，男DM\n底薪低，提成高\n。甚至无底薪。这种形式下，头部效应极强，头部有名气的单明面上的收入就三五万一个月，私下打赏未知，而中腰部的收入断崖下降</p>\n<p>而以前还比较重要的剧本作者的地位又下降一档，话语权不断降低。因为剧情好坏和最最重要的【\n核诡\n】在这种模式下，不是刚需了，不再决定生死</p>\n<p>近几年，类似于剧本杀密室女仆咖啡线下陪玩这些商业模式兴起，但在口罩时期和叠加线下经济的深度调整期，一半以上的剧本杀店已经倒闭，上海从顶峰2000多家下降到六七百家，巫师教你们一个词儿啊，就是你要说什么不行了，又怕敏感，你就说\n行业繁荣度不及预期，供给侧进入深度调整期</p>\n<p>从狼人杀店，桌游店变成了打本和密室，再到现在的恋陪，这背后，是传统的线下社交商业模式，偷偷靠向【男色经济】这种\n盈利确定性更大，需求更刚性，利润溢价更高\n的商业模式，是整个行业供给者趋利避害的合理选择</p>\n<p>男色消费变种</p>\n<p>拍照搭子</p>\n<p>如果说恋陪本还算是有中间商，那么很多人已经在平台上直接招贤纳士了，比如有人诚招帅哥来参加自己的毕业典礼，或者来拍毕业照</p>\n<p>硬性要求是帅+身高183以上，不算鞋底不算头发的真实裸高，性取向不限，只要帅，需要帮忙送花，花钱雇主出，需要和雇主一块strong的从同学面前路过，从描述看是一位非常贴心的雇主了，但想必\n对建模的要求极高\n，雇主也承认：本人阅帅哥无数，要求巨高，自认为“小帅”的被pass很正常，顶帅的话我花钱也会超大方的</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGj5vRCxhXejvicRv0Uaes8ynvy6bqsRJsbhicARgAhBuB6Jh4ic2ZbpxSoDibfm6mlrWxhw4Ticc7K3DicSy72B3khrvtbXVLibrr2vc/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=12"/></p>\n<p>巫师本以为这是个例或者是在整活，但是经过研究发现，这个需求非常普遍，大量的帖子正在招贤纳士，大家的需求基本相似，价格在100-200元每小时不等，也就是如果忙乎四个小时的话，能收大几百块的报酬，雇员一般情况下提供全套“仪式感”。除了拍照，还负责提供情绪价值，当然还有当天的拿包拿衣服等助理类的琐碎工作</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHSZ9bK0aTUia1KMM3TkzWM4Cwkedib9WPriaXNVViaMPWG5qZgJXSm7byFvUZZXL5azMssSrjTvPFlgibL2hfUtqxJ6kOFAQR2JL90/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=13"/></p>\n<p>然而这背后是一个巨大的市场，巫师说的不是毕业照，而是大家在平台上通过各种形式直接发帖雇佣小帅，另一种形式的Boss直聘了，这是典型的【\n平台经济\n】的雏形，只是现在还没有一个类似于【滴滴】之于出行需求的，能够完全收拢这种需求的单一平台</p>\n<p>这种需求里面有各种花里胡哨的形式，但内核相似</p>\n<p>拼好抱</p>\n<p>第一，"拼好抱"服务</p>\n<p>就是付费寻找帅哥来一场拥抱。抱完各回各家。此帖迅速引发共鸣，之后大量用户形成效仿</p>\n<p>还有人发布“抱后感”</p>\n<p>搭子经济</p>\n<p>第二，搭子经济，搭子经济本质还是地陪的一种变种，但最主要的区别是，必须要帅，要高，做一天有偿的搭子，内容包含但不限于吃饭，看电影，唱k，游乐场、动物园、水族馆、骑行、室内运动、滑雪、逛公园，爬山等等等，更激进一点的要求对方提供暧昧氛围，但谢绝更进一步的肢体接触</p>\n<p>相似的形式下，还有个壳，叫——\n陪拍师服务</p>\n<p>"陪拍"师除了为客户提供拍照和修片服务，还可陪同逛街、游览景点，就像花钱请了一位能拍会玩的伴侣，当然，雇主需要的是一个帅哥伴侣而且要实时提供情绪价值和照顾，在对帅的要求下，对于拍照设备的要求反而放在了第二位，长枪短炮的设备装逼流在【帅】面前，瞬间显得一文不值</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEYicw5icy2cO6mxzvq4m5EBR9CanXZfWNk0wJueINUaT7lNV2Gichxw9LraXic6KonnU7g9GS3cGibPBUzKMR3FuKm2kgPZlzUxRYA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=14"/></p>\n<p>无论是陪游，陪拍，一日搭子，或者一日男友等等服务，价格均在100-200元每小时，</p>\n<p>而在供给侧，有男生表示，自从做地陪后已经50次进出北京环球影城，一周内曾连续5天入园，熟悉到年卡通道的员工都认识他。为了提高服务品质，不少主打颜值的地陪，反而购置了专业补光套装、无人机等装备，也有人研究总结了很多景点“免排队”或逃票小窍门以此作为吸引顾客的噱头。当然，私下接单也存在诚信风险：对方临时爽约或“逃单”行为非常普遍</p>\n<p>有博主分享自己雇佣“男大生地陪”的经历：先在社媒上筛选“男大”陪游的帖子，他们通常详细列出自己的服务信息：价格、年龄、身高体重、熟悉的景点、最重要的是大量的自拍展示面，经过最近一段时间的竞争，供给侧也是\n卷起来了\n，</p>\n<p>他会帮你设计行程攻略、购票安排，全程陪伴讲解，摄影甚至还附赠修图，热情聊天、夸夸不断，还有的自备交通工具，相当有服务意识</p>\n<p>景区帅哥NPC</p>\n<p>第三，从2021年起，很多景区就开始批量雇佣"帅哥NPC"和“肌肉NPC”，这成为景区营销的新名片。从最开始的噱头，再到可以给游客提供简单合影，再到现在的百花齐放，很多景区已升级互动形式，牵手、拥抱、贴脸杀，借位接吻和喂棒棒糖等互动在社交媒体上爆火，很多景区也由此在短时间内获得大量流量，带动了当地的经济，当然自然又有一批媒体站在道德高地上一顿批判，说低俗什么的，虽然这些形式突破传统界限，但本质上还是逢场作戏，内核其实还是很克制，没有私下交易，男模本质还是商品属性，风险相较于前几种形式反而更加可控</p>\n<p>集大成者</p>\n<p>如果我们再把标准放宽，其实还有更多男色经济的场景正在冉冉升起</p>\n<p>比如主打帅哥和肌肉男服务的【猛男餐厅】，对标的是以前的女仆餐厅</p>\n<p>再比如用帅哥引流的二次元酒吧或者执事咖啡馆</p>\n<p>再比如视频平台的各形式的团播，尤其是男团的团播</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHfUpXpTR9MZuxiaiaXU4sqDld7YRI7LhzicsB898BAhiaAzUzjgtVoaR99eR6eM4PCia6eswDgJHB8nSyibke8Hatj1E5eQWULbDJm4/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=15"/></p>\n<p>以及男主播，"男模日记"赛道等等，以及后续衍生的消费，帅哥陪打游戏、语音陪伴、哄睡服务等等，当然重点还是帅，更重要的是声音好听</p>\n<p>线上另一块比较大的就是女性向纸片人，比如沉浸式乙女游戏赛道下的国乙四大天王，以及不那么注重恋爱的群像养成游戏，主打陪伴、多角色</p>\n<p>再小众一点，就是女频图文消费，其中耽美赛道的粘性和客单价尤为优秀，这个赛道真的很有意思，研究半天写了一堆，但最后巫师还是把这段删了（心疼），想了想，还是不要被大众注意的好，不要回复，不要回复</p>\n<p>但如果我们穿透这些细碎复杂的商业模式，男色经济中最最最集大成者是什么，又回到咱们的领域了，\n偶像经济</p>\n<p>男偶像唯一提供的价值就是【\n性魅力\n】，这个理论巫师说了无数遍，别跟我犟嘴说什么演技唱功内核，偶像经济之所以称之为“集大成者”，表层是他们的覆盖人群规模最庞大，营收和利润比以上所有赛道加起来还要再加两个0，但巫师不想列数据</p>\n<p>真正的牛逼之处在于水下，资本创造了一个“\n负熵\n”的商业奇迹： 它让一群本该是“上帝”的消费者，心甘情愿地成为了自带干粮、甚至倒贴钱的工具人</p>\n<p>消费者付了钱，不但没被服务，反而要去劳动</p>\n<p>"消费"包装成了"爱"，"被剥削"包装成"养成"，刷数据冲销量包装成了"战斗"，并且通过饭圈这个形式内部互相监督，形成压力闭环，消费者自己成了监工，监督其他消费者为资本劳动</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJGSwcCVV1fcyfL2Ql48jdw759uqB20qYuibxfwsozKth7bG1p76xr2HvnAuhibTfVX9d7vcR6icg9O170xPGOwlrykmch0sGJ4QoU/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=16"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHVxw9GoKgmmic1ia7CicIyxhBuqXfiact0yks1SNBJShGBbn4VhgVFs3icB53gWoExNGO7ESrYWiclppa7qPMbXdl4kp24uNlCtC4nc/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=17"/></p>\n<p>你是否还记得那句经典的——他只有我们了</p>\n<p>当然，偶像经济能达到如此大的规模自然有其合理性，巫师的明星与资本系列已经深度分析多次，巫师在投行职业生涯中把影视行业视为鄙视链最底层，幺蛾子多、引人注目，还都是小项目，烂项目，，只是这么多年明星与资本系列衍生出的无数暴论，你们可以当成商业思维启发的药引</p>\n<p>男色经济的内核</p>\n<p>跳出商业本身，我们拉到上帝视角</p>\n<p>中国经济正在处于深度调整期，消费数据的趋势明显，背后是人们在“消费降级”和“理性回归”中不断探索</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJH9yKZBTFjY4YG14joiac4zibbcIuzscTuTzWzEPNO24P2Nh1ibsbkvgz86z8ImFD9jjbicgz0xA8n5adpeug9T8UUJmppiaBzic2u60/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=18"/></p>\n<p>然而我们又势必要刺激内需拉动消费，下一个增长点，或许不一定非要在【物质消费】这个范围中寻找</p>\n<p>截止2024，中国一人户家庭，占比接近1/5，这包含了全年龄段的独居者</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEp4FOwfubpvE7SLicdMn3U9TInRe2TZ3wHO6ULoRgP3NfibJWFJ7Iia6JiakyEUMib28ls2K16dQNLeWfHsBd9D5ucufrBkvy9TjdA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=19"/></p>\n<p>同时，中国平均初婚年龄自2016年起快速提高，五年前的官方数据就已经接近30岁</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEymM4AgvD41XTtF2IC4L2rz64v0wUicOhfuVjiaiasrTibQRACdxjUZIHNicGWicpMofxF2qXf4ojYjv6T8xxIQmn5s191Myash2tOg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=20"/></p>\n<p>再有，工作节奏极限压缩社交机会，表面上每天都要应付很多人，但实际有效社交几乎为0的【\n新孤独态\n】成为打工人的常态</p>\n<p>其实很早就有人向精神消费和情绪消费探索，但是之前很多所谓的精神消费，巫师看来可以归为两类</p>\n<p>第一类是：没事儿找事儿</p>\n<p>第二类是：脱了裤子放屁</p>\n<p>然后都加上巨高的溢价，最后都沦为智商税筛选的笑柄</p>\n<p>大家可以把你认为的符合这两类的消费打在公屏上</p>\n<p>而任何一个正在野蛮发展的赛道，往往说明这个需求来自本源，是真实存在的而不是吹出来的，这个赛道虽然听上去有点上不了台面，但其内核要相对温和的多</p>\n<p>我们对比“男色经济”与“女色经济”的根本区别——即男性消费女色，中间披上了各种形式的外衣，但本质都是为了一个事儿，每个人都知道我在说什么，所以女色经济，其实\n非常单一、且风险极高，往往处于灰色甚至黑色区域\n，而这些区域也成为灰黑产重要的引流池子</p>\n<p>而男色经济则正好相反，也就是女性可不是为了所谓的最后一步，而是指向\n多维度的情感体验过程\n，这种多层次的需求，意味着商家可以创造出无数种不同的商品和服务SKU，从而形成一条长长的产业链，在每个环节都能产生溢价和GDP</p>\n<p>男性是要结果</p>\n<p>女性是要过程</p>\n<p>上述的各种男色经济的形式，就是这条长长的，注重过程的需求中，创造的细分商业模式，这种\n非线性、弥散状\n的需求，创造了比单纯的生理交易大得多的市场空间</p>\n<p>而【注重过程】这一重大区别，带来了另一大商业模式上的优势，就是“安全”与“温和，更不易涉及法律法规红线，从而让各种男色经济获得了在公域传播的合法性+合理性，甚至在需求不断释放，市场不断规范下，衍生为真正的平台经济</p>\n<p>同时创造出\n非体力的灵活就业</p>\n<p>虽然现在部分商业模式还存在隐患，但很多新兴行业都经历过"\n野蛮生长—乱象频发—监管和媒体监督介入—行业洗牌—规范化\n"的周期</p>\n<p>Ok。本期观点、文案、图表点个关注自取随便用，就说是你写的</p>\n<p>资本永不眠，下期见</p>', '3533686744-2247486644_1')
