      【巫师】美国干伊朗02，藏着对我们的资本阴招儿\n        </span>\n       </h1>\n       <div class="rich_media_meta_list" id="meta_content">\n        <span>\n         原创\n        </span>\n        <span>\n         <span>\n          巫师财经\n         </span>\n         <span style="display: none;">\n          巫师财经\n         </span>\n        </span>\n        <span>\n         <a class="wx_tap_link js_wx_tap_highlight weui-wa-hotarea" href="javascript:void(0);" id="js_name">\n          巫师财经\n         </a>\n         <div id="js_profile_card">\n         </div>\n        </span>\n        <span>\n         <em class="rich_media_meta rich_media_meta_text" id="publish_time">\n         </em>\n         <em class="rich_media_meta rich_media_meta_text" id="js_ip_wording_wrp" style="display: none;">\n          <span>\n          </span>\n          <span>\n          </span>\n         </em>\n         <em aria-labelledby="js_a11y_op_title_modify js_title_modify" class="rich_media_meta rich_media_meta_text" id="js_title_modify_wrp" role="option" style="display: none;">\n          <span>\n          </span>\n         </em>\n         <span style="display: none;">\n         </span>\n        </span>\n       </div>\n       <div class="novel-card js_wx_tap_highlight wx_tap_card" id="js_novel_card" style="display: none;">\n        <div class="novel-card__left novel-card__new-only">\n         <div class="novel-card__cover" id="js_novel_cover">\n          <img/>\n         </div>\n         <div class="novel-card__text">\n          <div class="novel-card__main" id="js_novel_title">\n           在小说阅读器读本章\n          </div>\n          <div class="novel-card__subtitle" id="js_novel_subtitle">\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="novel-card__link novel-card__new-only" id="js_novel_link">\n         去阅读\n        </div>\n        <div class="novel-info novel-card__old-only">\n         <div class="novel-cover-group">\n          <div class="novel-cover" id="js_novel_cover_old">\n           <img/>\n          </div>\n          <div class="novel-meta">\n           <div class="novel-title" id="js_novel_title_old">\n           </div>\n           <div class="novel-description">\n            在小说阅读器中沉浸阅读\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="arrow-jump-icon novel-card__old-only">\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class="rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection" id="js_content" style="visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; ">\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n         </span>\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           大家好我是巫师\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           最近研究半天发现，坏了，美国打伊朗，不会是冲着我们来的吧，因为藏了不少对我们的资本阴招，之前对面的颜色革命的洗脑战，科技战，贸易战，这些美国正面对华战争全都走进了死胡同，对方似乎想换个姿势，用更隐秘更阴险的姿势，对中国的伤害以"战争附带效果"的形式出现，避免了正面硬碰的成本\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n          <span>\n           <span style="font-weight: bold;">\n            第一层\n           </span>\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           先说第一层\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           明面上五大石油供应国为俄罗斯、沙特、马来西亚、伊拉克和巴西，没伊朗\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           但事实上呢，直接上表，你们随便用，就说你做的\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJG4iaedPHf2UU5SAEmpBS99ia06sseb9lDPv6jgoPIAguYe80a3PiaOmAqkHxKFRnfsicpxMibl3QHPuSG15452NtJfqCYlOOnLlyM0/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           伊朗油有一套精密的"换标"体系，尤其是以马来西亚，这个最大的"洗油"中心为主，还有印尼这个新兴的洗油通道，那没有官方数据怎么办呢，巫师把油轮追踪数据全部下载下来，把2025的伊朗实际供油量还原，可以看到伊朗排到了第三或者第四，大概占12%，数据源和我的推测依据都在里面了\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJFBgg5L5omSxlIjNL4rcQibFdQIFTCdYyLQ62YFz0c4FlU8MsTicrmVHd1aMiaWpeicfhhbtSGhictuWBRrXJkQ7bQRVPeKdM5ia5Cqg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           上期我说没进前五，这里勘误一下，只是我国长期以来的能源安全战略，其实就是为了防止这种事发生，就是不能太依赖某一个国家的石油\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           美国打伊朗的附带效果是，霍尔木兹海峡是封锁了全球30%的海运石油\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHicVgiaVJ9ibwTAgic5hEnqQ7d439K9JN0IzJhJzCYqH5hCbnek5cteGVKnMN9N39AX7CQs76pabXE0ZVmkPq7fIDNhXfvWTbjp4g/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           巫师把我的研究逻辑展开，你们吹逼的时候可以直接用，巫师把这些给中国的油分了四档\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           第一档是扎扎实实的封上了，伊朗，科威特，卡塔尔的油就是这一挡，这些油占中国进口的15-17%\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           第二档是重度依赖霍尔木兹，仅有极少绕行能力，代表国就是伊拉克，伊拉克对华出口中的90%受影响，剩下10%能迂回运到中国，但运距长、运费高，实际到货量可能更少，这一档约100-110万桶/日实际断供\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           第三档是有绕行替代，但远不足以替代海运量，沙特阿拉伯就是其中代表，沙特理论上可以绕行，但受胡塞武装影响，其绕行能力可能被高估，而且沙特出口全球的油都要想办法绕行，也不能光卖给我们，这一档合计75-100万桶/日实际断供\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           第四档就是完全不受霍尔木兹影响，俄罗斯，巴西，委内瑞拉，安哥拉/西非等，所以结论给你们一个表\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           巫师算的实际断供占中国总进口的35%，当然这个表是巫师的慌忙的dirty work，不精确，而且局势还在变，但巫师想到怎么交叉验证了\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHQmibKiaWIRYmKZ3pDzfXdJZ9x93JiaAfdCFoD3hHbB2iaYAX4wrS5FTU1egJpECaWCuYMkicAwrm5eKZnEv19s2WV7mCXMypAbg1E/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           翻了翻Kpler的报告，Kpler早期曾经说过40%的中国石油进口经霍尔木兹海峡，巫师现在算的是35%，大差不差吧，你们凑合用\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           这是第一层\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n          <span>\n           <span style="font-weight: bold;">\n            第二层\n           </span>\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           第二层来了\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           美国眼里的中国，就是个巨型肥肉。以前的颜色革命，现在的关税战、科技战，本质上是正面强攻，结果打了这么多年，舆论洗脑失败，意林和公知全部进了版本下水道，科技芯片封锁，AI封锁，反而逼出国产替代产业链和Deepseek时刻，对华贸易战更是搞笑，逆差没收窄，中国在外贸上还在框框赚钱，2025年度咱们创造了1.19万亿美元的顺差，在各种不利因素下，创造了人类经济史上的奇迹，这是人类有经济记录以来，第一个货物贸易顺差突破1万亿美元的国家\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHsfVBlphpkGRI2oh6QWpk2jx4hURhsUTXDH5T3E4nzMIOC0diafHwGJPoDJGicbFoicPKTcTSK84Y2draBjnw9lzNWOlUUxh0ljI/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           洗脑战，科技战，贸易战，这些正面收割全都走进了死胡同，那就换个姿势，改打我们的工业链，其中的关键就是石油和相关化工原料，毕竟咱们在能源上确实是个短板，对外依赖很高\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           上期我测算过，油价对老百姓CPI的影响虽然小，但对工厂的生产成本（PPI）影响大，传导系数大约7.4%，而且如果后续涨到100甚至120美元一桶，PPI还会被推高2-3个百分点\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHQgbBM7ic2QQU01nycpicTyW6iaoObjgnhVD9f3R0SO02bibOBsUPQB4u89nEnqicVorKphY7AymI8dXIKMMvOsT5IPXwmxOIJAhmQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           上期视频我为什么展示纯苯2604苯乙烯2604等等的价格，很多人不明白，因为还有大量的化工原料的出口被封锁的效用被低估了，中国是这些东西的最大消费国\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           打开化工商品的交易面板， 先是甲醇，中东地区甲醇占中国进口的60%以上，其次是乙苯，就是做苯乙烯的。再有就是纯苯，化工界的"面粉"，拿它可以做出一大堆东西：染料、塑料、橡胶、药品、洗涤剂，中国是全球最大纯苯消费国，\n          </span>\n         </span>\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n          </span>\n         </span>\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           再有PX，做PTA，最终变成涤纶，也就是你身上穿的衣服\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           再有PE，聚乙烯，全世界用量最大的塑料，没有之一。塑料袋、保鲜膜、水管，PE我国每年进口量千万吨级别，我们来源主要是沙特、伊朗、阿联酋和东南亚\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           再有，LPG，就是液化石油气，阿联酋、沙特、卡塔尔是主要来源\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           再有，乙二醇，一是做涤纶，跟PTA配合，二是做防冻液，中国是全球最大进口国，沙特是头号供应商\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           所以这一系列东西涨价，最终会影响我们这个工业克苏鲁，但你以为这就完了么\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n          <span>\n           <span style="font-weight: bold;">\n            第三层\n           </span>\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           我开头"马来西亚"这个第三名实际上是个壳，如果把中国从马来西亚进口量，减去马来西亚自己的产油量，大家以为剩下的部分就是伊朗了，但巫师告诉你不只是伊朗，还有委内瑞拉\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           还记得牢美刚刚干过什么事儿吧，之前牢美干委内瑞拉，现在牢美干伊朗，Trump疯疯癫癫，到处瞎出招，但还真波及到了我们\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           制裁收紧、海上拦截加码，然后战争和封锁，伊朗加委内瑞拉一起清零，我们少了15-18%的原油来源和大幅的甲醇缺口，还有无数上述化工原料的进口受阻\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           再下一步攥住咽喉。霍尔木兹、马六甲、苏伊士、巴拿马、好望角，都能投射力量，而红海-曼德海峡已经因胡塞武装常态化骚扰而半瘫痪，只需要"选择性反恐"就能控制通行节奏；而且巴拿马运河的主权争议已经被Trump公开提上台面；马六甲海峡周边，美国在新加坡、菲律宾、印尼都有军事存在或准入协议\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           不需要同时封锁所有通道。只需要让每条通道都处于"可能被卡"的不确定状态，甚至五角大楼为了自己贪点钱，主动搞点局部摩擦，别的不说，航运保险费率就会系统性上浮，而且相应的原油和化工附属品价格都会波动，中国的贸易成本就会在持续失血\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           当然，中国除了从海上进口原油和化工品，还有咱们这个邻居，俄罗斯是个变量。俄罗斯是中国第一大供应国。但俄罗斯的心眼很多，他们最期盼着中国和美国狠狠干一架，而且巫师想说，越跟我们掰扯利益的国家，事实上我们从中收益越多。反而天天越跟我们喊口号喊友谊的国家，他们从我们这儿捞的利益越多，要防着俄罗斯把我们当成筹码卖给美国，很多人会反驳，但我更倾向于俄罗斯的终极利益是恢复欧洲市场的利益，中国市场是制裁时期的替代方案而非首选。我们就是个备胎罢了，等他的欧美白月光又开始吊着他了，你看他舔不舔就完事了，一个热知识——他以前可没少舔\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           当能源和化工贸易路线风险波动，我们就有点难受，作为世界第一大工业国，不说廉价原料吧，制造业需要稳定供应和价格稳定的原料，这在经济上的不确定性大幅增加，而且这将成为我们在小岛问题硬碰硬的时候的一个巨大顾虑\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 21.3333px;">\n          <span>\n           <span style="font-weight: bold;">\n            反制\n           </span>\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           巫师既然想到了这一点，国家肯定也想到了，那怎么办呢，我们目前有巨量的原油战略储备，甲醇港口库存145万吨处于历史高位，暂时还是有很大安全冗余\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHzJrFH6R7fLh3QVCJcVDTfj6KQUZM7rCz4hT6EmjQS0y1Ihf7t44LVJuNhAMfTibsSJNYRiazNWsj6Tcott6HkjjZjOjt6uQE3I/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           而且国内甲醇产能虽然成本高但技术成熟。而且我们手里也有反制牌——稀土、关键矿产、供应链，大豆和波音订单，美国同样有有求于中国的环节\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           再进一步，对手绝不是全知全能的理性行为体，他们内部就算有这个计划，也执行不了几步，都是草台班子，虽然委内瑞拉、伊朗和霍尔木兹已经实现了，但后面不一定\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           但我们比较难受在于，这一套战争附加余波的阴招，它不需要走到最后一步就已经在生效\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           因为防守方的成本永远高于进攻方。每年进口42亿桶原油，每桶成本上升10美元就是420亿美元的额外支出。光是把原油从70美元推到90-100美元，把甲醇从2500涨到3500，把航运保险费率翻一倍，我国制造业的最重要的群体，也就是中国经济的最精英的生力军，就已经很难受了\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           事实上，我们当然可以通过上期提到的SPR也就是战略石油储备操作来缓解，\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJEzsxg9eSVRH0WUt6FnnYtAv4XRxqAZ6PAVEuicVelO6BFMd44M5x6eFNv7VmJZsHYtz0TG8LHNgkibESfufnVhVIR9ZmNhEVgVk/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           也包括政府和企业部门在大宗资本市场上进行操作，甚至包括更隐蔽的手段来增加自己的安全垫，但都附带相应的成本，金融市场和大宗市场的操作其实处于表面层\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           还是巫师的爆论，很多人觉得太极端了，但我一直觉得说什么经济金融，最底层还是军事实力，要我说，咱们的船还是太少了，海空军还是太小了，必须把我们的实力投射到这些关键卡脖子的运输要道，在那些海峡，港口我们也能开过去，为全球贸易航路的稳定，为全人类的发展，发挥定海神针的效用，顺带着，嘿嘿，保护我们自己的利益，但这是巫师的最“中”幻想了，我们先努努力冲出第一岛链再说，但我这个思路绝对是【治本】的思路\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           关于军工体系，可以去看我军贸分析和拆解军工这两期，拆解军工那期太惨了，认认真真弄了一个月，结果没人看\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJHaIFbOk1DYnJO6to5qmV95X1fphuiaQtDibLEjfeib3aO7PnhnlibP4Bq2HmFrWZys7j5dy8Foh1rWNgq3XkhjNCeVqRIT9FAmxg4/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n           <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/hmkxKic9qKJErxjxjoGSqtVvQib1WnXC2XnpgJEbfkZ2vlrlI6PTibA75rCrSib8oFCR2xLQGUb6k9zGRFHlNyhfUSmiaErU4mhAS65W5gHIXpsc/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg" style="left:0px;top:0px;width:100%;background-color:transparent;"/>\n          </section>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           这期就这样，所有数据图表文案点个关注随便用，就说是你写的\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <section powered-by="werss">\n         <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n          <span>\n           资本永不眠下期见\n          </span>\n         </span>\n        </section>\n        <p style="display: none;">\n         <mp-style-type data-value="3">\n         </mp-style-type>\n        </p>\n       </div>\n       <script nonce="487950976" reportloaderror="" type="text/javascript">\n        var first_sceen__time = (+new Date());\n            if ("" == 1 && document.getElementById(\'js_content\')) {\n              document.getElementById(\'js_content\').addEventListener("selectstart",function(e){ e.preventDefault(); });\n            }\n       </script>\n      </div>\n      <div class="article-tag__error-tips" id="js_tags_preview_toast" style="display: none;">\n       预览时标签不可点\n      </div>\n      <div id="content_bottom_area">\n      </div>\n      <div id="font_pannel_area">\n      </div>\n      <div class="rich_media_tool_area" id="js_temp_bottom_area">\n       <div class="rich_media_tool__wrp">\n        <div class="rich_media_tool">\n         <div class="rich_media_info weui-flex">\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="rich_media_area_primary sougou" id="sg_tj" style="display:none">\n    </div>\n    <div class="rich_media_area_extra">\n     <div class="rich_media_area_extra_inner">\n      <div id="page_bottom_area">\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="qr_code_pc_outer" id="js_pc_qr_code" style="display:none;">\n     <div class="qr_code_pc_inner">\n      <div class="qr_code_pc">\n       <img/>\n       <p>\n        微信扫一扫\n        <br/>\n        关注该公众号\n       </p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class="wx_stream_article_slide_tip" id="wx_stream_article_slide_tip">\n    <div class="wx_stream_article_slide_tip_wrp">\n     <span>\n     </span>\n     <span>\n      继续滑动看下一个\n     </span>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class="wx_network_msg_wrp" id="js_network_msg_wrp">\n  </div>\n  <div class="wx_expand_article" id="wx_expand_article">\n   <div class="wx_expand_article_gradient_background" id="wx_expand_background">\n   </div>\n   <div class="wx_expand_article_bottom_area" id="wx_expand_bottom">\n    <div class="wx_expand_article_button_wrap" id="wx_expand_article_placeholder">\n     <button class="wx_expand_article_button" id="wx_expand_article_button">\n      轻触阅读原文\n     </button>\n    </div>\n    <div class="stream_bottom_bar_wrp" id="js_stream_bottom_bar">\n     <div class="bottom_bar_placeholder" id="js_stream_bottom_bar_placeholder">\n      <div class="wx_follow_context wx_follow_primary wx_follow_smart wx_follow_top wx_follow_bottom">\n       <div class="function_mod js_function_mod wx_tap_cell">\n        <div class="function_mod_inner js_function_mod_inner">\n         <div class="function_bd">\n          <div class="wx_follow_media weui-flex weui-flex_align-center">\n           <div class="wx_follow_hd">\n            <span>\n             <img src="http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/A5AZPRIiakEIhcjXobvFF8FDDoabQibiaMTW3LBXK5VD5ciaKeWYxQia4GxOHv8v6WJUkZwetGNGvWtUoanWNTuIgMQ/0?wx_fmt=png">\n             </img>\n            </span>\n           </div>\n           <div class="wx_follow_bd weui-flex__item">\n            <div class="wx_follow_info">\n             <div aria-describedby="js_wx_follow_tips" aria-labelledby="js_wx_follow_nickname" class="wx_follow_nickname" role="link" tabindex="0">\n              巫师财经\n             </div>\n            </div>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class="interaction_bar__wrap" style="opacity: 1;">\n       <div class="interaction_bar" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;">\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div id="stream_article_bottom_area">\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class="wx_expand_article_slide_tip" id="wx_expand_slidetip">\n    <div class="wx_stream_article_slide_tip">\n     <div class="wx_stream_article_slide_tip_wrp">\n      <span>\n      </span>\n      <span>\n       向上滑动看下一个\n      </span>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div id="js_ad_control">\n  </div>\n  <div id="audio_panel_area">\n  </div>\n  <div id="js_profile_card_modal">\n  </div>\n  <div class="comment_primary_emotion_panel_wrp" id="js_emotion_panel_pc" style="display: none">\n   <div class="comment_primary_emotion_panel">\n    <ul class="comment_primary_emotion_list_