{'id': '0YlSDg4yjp6mtGKg2x_Eww', 'title': '【巫师】美联储和Trump的资本博弈', 'author': '巫师财经', 'description': '', 'topic_image': 'https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCkX3MgBZuCYsvNH6EoSN30f71aSJ0hZia7J753zvMlyhiajOC54SIibaQw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg', 'publish_time': 1748595600, 'content': '<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: left; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); min-height: 29px; font-size: 29px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   恩怨\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   大好我巫师，美联储和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的资本博弈，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   看似都是为公为民，但背地里都是一万个心眼\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   宏观经济和货币政策的算法我认为都是配菜，我看到的主线就三个大字\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   【不粘锅】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump2017\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   年提名鲍威尔担任美联储主席，彼时\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   期待鲍威尔延续低利率政策以刺激经济，这样\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   可以交上一份【把经济搞好了】的答卷\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   但鲍威尔上任后，反手给了\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   一刀，也表演了一出【看看我们美联储多美独立】的戏码，鲍威尔为应对通胀风险于\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   18\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   年启动加息，与\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   背道而驰。\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump就\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   公开说鲍威尔为\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   笨蛋\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   最大敌人\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，那会儿就开始威胁解雇鲍威尔了，但鲍威尔强调政策是基于经济而非政治\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   巫师认为那会儿就已经演上了，然后\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第二任期时，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   依旧希望美联储可以尽快降息以实现短期内的乐观经济数据，美联储继续展示自己的独立性\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   我就不！我就不！\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   当然\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   同时也是演给选民看，你美联储不降息就是故意和政敌联手搞我，故意把经济弄得那么差，但美联储则说\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的关税政策才是罪魁祸首，并可能引发\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   滞胀\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   （我关税战视频\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   01-04\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   已经多次提到过滞涨，不再重复）\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   然后\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   继续威胁解雇鲍威尔，都是老一套，而所谓的解雇也是纯纯做梦，理论上存在通路，但事实上难以落地\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   还试图通过设立\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   影子美联储主席\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   推动最高法院裁决等方式削弱鲍威尔权威，但反而给了鲍威尔更大的表演舞台，誓言捍卫独立性，反而显得美联储更加\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   伟光正”，好几届美联储主席都有过相似的表演，为什么巫师老说人家是表演，你看完你就会理解我\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.7; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); min-height: 24px; font-size: 24px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   为什么死活不降息\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   美联储死活不降息也是有道理的，人家是有阵痛的，50年前美联储迎合白宫的超宽松货币政策，导致高通胀与高失业并存，瞎干比不干更糟糕\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   此外，美联储因低估通胀而被迫激进加息的教训历历在目，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   2021\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   被诟病延续\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   后视镜决策\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，让美联储对政策转向更加谨慎\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   但我们更深一步，白宫和美联储的较量历史由来已久，其实每个年代的较量都脱不开【分锅】这个主题，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   想要甩锅，美联储又何尝不想呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   美联储如果很早就降息，一旦通胀失控，那\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   就可以怪物价上涨是美联储的锅，美联储也知道这一点，自然不能\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   瓜田李下\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，到时候大家也不知道是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   齐宣王的锅更多，还是美联储【不够独立从而提前降息】的锅更多，美联储要干的就俩事，一是【物价】，也就是抑制通胀，二是【就业】，但物价才是民众最能直接感受到的【经济答卷】，而物价的本质就是美元的购买力，Which是美联储的核心任务，而美联储死活不降息，可将可能使物价抬头责任\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   100%\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   指向总统，同时还能展现自己【独立】和【强硬】的人设，一石二鸟\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   相反的，如果真迫于压力降息了，汇率更崩，通胀更猛，加息三年的成果短时间内被消耗殆尽，等物价真崩了，民众发现WOC我竟然我是那个代价，五十万马克一个面包的故事大家听过吗，落榜美术生的故事听过吧，不是美术生会飞，而是他会借势飞升，什么势？民粹之势，就算一切还没那么糟糕，内部矛盾还没膨胀到爆炸，美联储再想修复信用要么像沃尔克硬着陆出清，要么就用美联储再当十年老鼠来填补，无论怎么样，站在美联储角度，别看他站在经济数据和函数计算的话语体系，分析一大堆说不降息，本质上降息后面全是【死门】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   而且以前经济好的时候总统瞎折腾没什么，而在某东方大国的虎视眈眈下，在去美元的压力下，容易一跌不起，照这么折腾，我想问你美国还有几个十年？\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   谁都不想当这个造成一跌不起的罪人\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   再有，美元的高利率说白了就是维持美元吸引力，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   4.5\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的基准利率仍能吸引国际资本流入美债。而美国资本市场已形成复杂的嵌套对冲机制，降息可能导致利差收窄、跨境资本流出，进而引发\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   股债汇三杀\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，那会儿的美联储会更难受，形成\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   降息\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   →\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   资本外逃\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   →又\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   被迫加息\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的尴尬境地，等到那会儿，民众可是不懂宏观经济的，一看你美联储朝令夕改的狼狈样子，就感觉是你美联储犯了大错，反而白宫就能美美隐身\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   那如果你是美联储主席，你应该怎么办呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   巫师带入鲍威尔的角色，如果是我，就一个字\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   拖\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第一，拖到总统的政策对经济冲击充分显现，将经济疲软归因于白宫\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第二，拖到通胀数据明确降温，为降息提供合理依据\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第三，拖到资本市场风险出清，避免政策调整触发系统性危机\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   即使我的任期到了，美联储依旧会遵循不粘锅理论，我美联储的耐心和演技，比你\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的任期更坚挺\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.7;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(26, 26, 26);min-height: 24px;font-size: 24px;">\n  <span>\n   演给谁看\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   左边是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   甩锅小算盘，同时想通过政策的不断反复，操纵资本市场，以实现家族成员和华尔街朋友们的最大盈利\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   而右边美联储一方面是【不粘锅】，二是继续夯实自己的【独立可信】人设\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我为什么用人设这个词，巫师以前在投行的时候，也以为他们是【先进的】、【文明的】、【复杂的】、【高级的】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   当民众试图了解美联储的政策时，常常陷入金融知识的复杂性中，而这正是上层希望民众保持的状态，就是懂一点，但还是云里雾里，尤其是面对美联储官方发布的那些大量的研究报告，12个人的利率观点分布，经济论文，各种晦涩的经济理论和函数，看起来那么厚重，那么专业，那么厉害\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我也可以从那个角度来做一期，我甚至能预判到，有弹幕评论呼吁就要硬核干燥，就要进入美联储的话语体系中，那你就上套了，因为你会看到这些、这些、这些、这些、这些、这些（\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   6\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   个）\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCwVfHkT912Via5xO5CnDmmZUMOOCb5uv8Jt5iccXqDepV496VH0m6QsBw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCzYqwRLroB82FibOMY6o0pdzS48Mgz47xgHunibQhY3TbS7AIcSoPofww/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCGCYWHv7mQu9XIz6IGTJRHEArTTUW9GiaIJib2U597iaLhLKGBtHvlNESQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCY8nIY1DNIclCtXgvPnl257LYNUqMUhRhmpaicdic2wtjXmB8zGCMJC2w/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCicHWdL8nZXguiasK4MtJia6mWgezppzBhk6dDSq2sXVaZibtBE0GaTOAaw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCcdxzxmibfypYicrmuL8RDGaEJc0iaEmZibZr3JppvwaG18heiaic1gh7zkYg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我就算把这些模块化的、标准化的，卖方用来做研究的模板给过一遍，对的，我们有个大Excel文件，里面全是这些图，写好公式可以调用Bloomberg的接口实时刷出最新数据，图就自动更新了，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   dirty work\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   做多了我也会背了，只不过我能不能给大家说明白，我不敢保证，但我可以保证一点，就是那会儿大家不是睡了就是跑了，本来评论区就经常说我靡靡之音容易犯困，你们动不动就先睡为敬\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   但其中还算有点用的，就是对美联储\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   12\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   人本身的研究，就是看他们的言论来预判未来的货币政策\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCIodNQKgOBwc2zyGXsTcwZsliaxUJtbsKN4fbI6gAaibKqwia55ibv5Ejrw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   你看外资\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   House\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的研报，特别喜欢把这\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   12\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   个人分为鸽派和鹰派，但我觉得这就像锄地的农民幻想皇帝的生活，就是用金锄头锄地，这种感觉，我甚至觉得这也是一种分析师们的美化，美化美联储的高级感，美化自己研究的复杂性和不可替代性，其实根本没那么复杂，好像他们内部真的有那么多，严肃又高级又复杂的\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   学术讨论\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   一样，还分拨分派的，人五人六的\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我以一个基层分析师做\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   dirty work\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的视角，可能有点井底之蛙，但我觉得，其实很多人都是摆设，其实就听那两三个人的，甚至【两三个】这个量词，我都是多说了\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   大量的文件、报告和数据，其实都是有模板的，我们每次下载下来最新的版本，其实都是用工具去找和上一个版本的区别，而其中大段大段的内容，都是冗余重复的，我自己称他为【金融屎山】，我以前也会跟我同事抱怨，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   nm\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   怎么这么多废话，而且都是专有名词和术语的堆叠，大量复杂的算法和函数的堆积\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   论文和研究报告更是一堆屎，但没办法大家必须赤石，毕竟金融从业者都觉得美联储公布的东西都是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   圣旨\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   啊\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   里面真正的干货有没有？\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   有\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   但我得在几百吨屎里找那几百克融化了的巧克力，而我为了完成\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   dirty work\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ，我必须得尝，因为我光靠看和闻还不够，分辨不出来，人家确实很专业，内容确实极其详实，我不尝，我就没发分辨这一坨到底是史还是巧克力，等我知道它是史了，它的味道已经留在我的唇齿之间久久不能散去了，然后我要再继续去尝下一坨\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   所以我很多时候觉得我在害人，很多人看了我早期的视频，觉得投行很酷，不明觉厉，决定去学金融去干金融，结果一入行，发现完蛋了被迫吃屎，而且那时候回头也晚了，最惨的是金融行业还降薪了，早年投行收入还是可以随便碾压普通人的，但等我的观众入职时已经很多年之后了\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   在这段时间，经济环境发生天翻地覆的变化，甚至由于我们同事的女朋友在某书平台上炫富，给投行全行业集体整降薪了，而且这种事儿还出了两次\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   还有，当时很多金融人特别喜欢叫自己金融民工嘛，我以前也是，看起来在自谦，背地里其实是隐隐的傲慢与偏见，但行业由于多重因素的不断降薪后，可能真比不上人家高水平民工的时薪了，咱们大\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   A\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   多长时间没有\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   IPO\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   了，投行部门多久没扩张了，大券商走了多少人了，所有【不明觉厉】的幻象，终将被现实打破\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   美联储也是一样，一通复杂化的数据堆积，其实就是为了展现，我们最后算出来\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   4.5%\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   这个数，不是拍脑袋，而是经过了缜密的几百几千页的计算，经过了美联储内部各个派系的辩论，搞出来的一个【可信任】的【大工程】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   但现在美联储的【不明觉厉】的幻象，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;background-color: inherit;">\n  <span>\n   被谁戳破了呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   就是屏幕前的你和我，这回我没开玩笑，而且你使用了【釜底抽薪】这张牌\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.7;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(26, 26, 26);min-height: 24px;font-size: 24px;">\n  <span>\n   釜底抽薪\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   <br/>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.7;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   你们按照我投行底层的井底之蛙视角继续看啊，被全球金融从业者视为圣经的美联储，大家的共识是，美联储不向总统低眉折腰，强硬独立，非常值得信任对吧，从业者常常认为美联储背后的信任是其基石，我刚入行那会儿也是这么想的\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我现在提出我第二个暴论，美联储的根基不在于信任，而在于霸权背后的军事力量\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   靠的是一次又一次的入侵\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   靠的是反对它的政府一个又一个倒台\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   靠的是碍它事儿的民族一次又一次被屠杀\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   比起所谓的信任，拳头\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   才是背后支撑一切的地基，是航母，是隐身战机，是星罗棋布的美军基地，是信息化武器的硬实力碾压，美联储的信任只是表象，而中国人是在一步步蚕食【霸权】的地基，中国的牌叫做釜底抽薪，而霸权一旦松懈，美联储那\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   12\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   个人再怎么表演【信任】，全球的资产阶级也会用脚投票的\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   毕竟，谁赢，他们帮谁\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   黑帮大哥要让大家服帖，要满足两个条件，一是足够残忍，二是武力要能碾压江湖上其他存在，现在旁边坐了一个体型庞大，快速发育的大熊猫，兜里也踹了一堆不可名状武器，这只熊猫也不跟你抢地盘，还笑嘻嘻的和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   黑帮\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   大哥做生意，而且笑的越来越渗人，兜里武器越来越多，越来越看不懂，你是如果是美国，你这个\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   大哥\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   还能当得安心吗\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   更离谱的是，自己兜里的武器已经【空心】，厉害是厉害，但是工业能力已经空心化，甚至为了维护老大的威严，不得不和拖鞋军打的有来有回\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">\n  <span>\n   美联储只是美国衰退的修补匠而已\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   只是这个修补匠格外爱惜自己的羽毛，还特别能装\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   当然美联储的强势独立人设目前还是立得住的，但比如网上很多视频吹保罗沃克多么传奇，这种就是把他们往神坛上推了，我不太喜欢，在我看来美联储只是履行最基本的职责，保证货币的稳定而已，巫师自己随着年龄的增加，随着祖国的崛起，美联储的高级感滤镜，一点一点碎掉了\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.7;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(26, 26, 26);min-height: 24px;font-size: 24px;">\n  <span>\n   买定离手\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我做视频时，最近一次新闻发布会美联储强调了关税刺激通胀和失业率上升的担忧。由于\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的贸易政策下经济路径存在不确定性，也就是对中国又打又怂的，美联储采取观望态度\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   光说不练假把式，我这套【不粘锅】理论到底行不行，我来预测一下\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   最近一次议息会议和最近的美联储发言都说观望，所以我们预测个长期的\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   首先我认为未来的三次议息会议都不会降息，也就是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   6\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   月、\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   7\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   月和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   9\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   月的三次，就是我说的\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   拖\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   在这个基础之上呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   Bloomberg上随便搜搜外资House的分析师，他们普遍预计今年将有两次25个基点的降息，而我甚至认为未来五次议息会议都不会降息，而且 Trmup 会越来越怂\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   可能不太符合市面上美联储相关文章视频的主流观点，但以上就是我的愚见了，抛砖引玉，买定离手，还是那句话，预测对了，你赚了就偷偷给我点个关注，预测错了，那你就回来骂我\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   最后，中美就算现在各退一步，那也有终局之战，躲得过初一躲不过十五，拖也没用，具体去看关税战\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   01\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的论证，现在所有仅仅基于美联储本身的分析，面对咱们的釜底抽薪，都显得非常单薄\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   老规矩，本期的图、表、数据、文案都开源，点个关注随便用，老地方取，资本永不眠，下期见\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-bottom: 0px;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style="display: none;">\n <mp-style-type data-value="3">\n </mp-style-type>\n</p>\n', 'mp_info': {'mp_name': '巫师财经', 'logo': 'https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/A5AZPRIiakEIhcjXobvFF8FDDoabQibiaMTW3LBXK5VD5ciaKeWYxQia4GxOHv8v6WJUkZwetGNGvWtUoanWNTuIgMQ/300?wx_fmt=png&wxfrom=18', 'biz': 'MzUzMzY4Njc0NA=='}, 'mp_id': 'MP_WXS_3533686744', 'article_type': 0, 'fetch_error': ''}
[SQL] UPDATE articles SET description=?, status=?, has_content=?, content=?, content_html=? WHERE articles.id = ?
[参数] ('<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: left; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); min-height: 29px; font-size: 29px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   恩怨\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   大好我巫师，美联储和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的资本博弈，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   看似都是为公为民，但背地里都是一万个心眼\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   宏观经济和货币政策的算法我认为都是配菜，我看到的主线就三个大字\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   【不粘锅】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump2017\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   年提名鲍威尔担任美联储主席，彼时\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   期待鲍威尔延续低利率政策以刺激经济，这样\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   可以交上一份【把经济搞好了】的答卷\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   但鲍威尔上任后，反手给了\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   一刀，也表演了一出【看看我们美联储多美独立】的戏码，鲍威尔为应对通胀风险于\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   18\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   年启动加息，与\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   背道而驰。\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump就\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   公开说鲍威尔为\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   笨蛋\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   最大敌人\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，那会儿就开始威胁解雇鲍威尔了，但鲍威尔强调政策是基于经济而非政治\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   巫师认为那会儿就已经演上了，然后\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第二任期时，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   依旧希望美联储可以尽快降息以实现短期内的乐观经济数据，美联储继续展示自己的独立性\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   我就不！我就不！\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   当然\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   同时也是演给选民看，你美联储不降息就是故意和政敌联手搞我，故意把经济弄得那么差，但美联储则说\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的关税政策才是罪魁祸首，并可能引发\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   滞胀\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   （我关税战视频\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   01-04\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   已经多次提到过滞涨，不再重复）\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   然后\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   继续威胁解雇鲍威尔，都是老一套，而所谓的解雇也是纯纯做梦，理论上存在通路，但事实上难以落地\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   还试图通过设立\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   影子美联储主席\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   推动最高法院裁决等方式削弱鲍威尔权威，但反而给了鲍威尔更大的表演舞台，誓言捍卫独立性，反而显得美联储更加\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   伟光正”，好几届美联储主席都有过相似的表演，为什么巫师老说人家是表演，你看完你就会理解我\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.7; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); min-height: 24px; font-size: 24px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   为什么死活不降息\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   美联储死活不降息也是有道理的，人家是有阵痛的，50年前美联储迎合白宫的超宽松货币政策，导致高通胀与高失业并存，瞎干比不干更糟糕\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   此外，美联储因低估通胀而被迫激进加息的教训历历在目，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   2021\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   被诟病延续\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   后视镜决策\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，让美联储对政策转向更加谨慎\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   但我们更深一步，白宫和美联储的较量历史由来已久，其实每个年代的较量都脱不开【分锅】这个主题，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   想要甩锅，美联储又何尝不想呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   美联储如果很早就降息，一旦通胀失控，那\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   就可以怪物价上涨是美联储的锅，美联储也知道这一点，自然不能\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   瓜田李下\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，到时候大家也不知道是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   齐宣王的锅更多，还是美联储【不够独立从而提前降息】的锅更多，美联储要干的就俩事，一是【物价】，也就是抑制通胀，二是【就业】，但物价才是民众最能直接感受到的【经济答卷】，而物价的本质就是美元的购买力，Which是美联储的核心任务，而美联储死活不降息，可将可能使物价抬头责任\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   100%\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   指向总统，同时还能展现自己【独立】和【强硬】的人设，一石二鸟\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   相反的，如果真迫于压力降息了，汇率更崩，通胀更猛，加息三年的成果短时间内被消耗殆尽，等物价真崩了，民众发现WOC我竟然我是那个代价，五十万马克一个面包的故事大家听过吗，落榜美术生的故事听过吧，不是美术生会飞，而是他会借势飞升，什么势？民粹之势，就算一切还没那么糟糕，内部矛盾还没膨胀到爆炸，美联储再想修复信用要么像沃尔克硬着陆出清，要么就用美联储再当十年老鼠来填补，无论怎么样，站在美联储角度，别看他站在经济数据和函数计算的话语体系，分析一大堆说不降息，本质上降息后面全是【死门】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   而且以前经济好的时候总统瞎折腾没什么，而在某东方大国的虎视眈眈下，在去美元的压力下，容易一跌不起，照这么折腾，我想问你美国还有几个十年？\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   谁都不想当这个造成一跌不起的罪人\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   再有，美元的高利率说白了就是维持美元吸引力，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   4.5\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的基准利率仍能吸引国际资本流入美债。而美国资本市场已形成复杂的嵌套对冲机制，降息可能导致利差收窄、跨境资本流出，进而引发\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   股债汇三杀\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，那会儿的美联储会更难受，形成\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   降息\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   →\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   资本外逃\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   →又\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   被迫加息\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的尴尬境地，等到那会儿，民众可是不懂宏观经济的，一看你美联储朝令夕改的狼狈样子，就感觉是你美联储犯了大错，反而白宫就能美美隐身\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   那如果你是美联储主席，你应该怎么办呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   巫师带入鲍威尔的角色，如果是我，就一个字\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   拖\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第一，拖到总统的政策对经济冲击充分显现，将经济疲软归因于白宫\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第二，拖到通胀数据明确降温，为降息提供合理依据\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第三，拖到资本市场风险出清，避免政策调整触发系统性危机\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   即使我的任期到了，美联储依旧会遵循不粘锅理论，我美联储的耐心和演技，比你\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的任期更坚挺\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.7;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(26, 26, 26);min-height: 24px;font-size: 24px;">\n  <span>\n   演给谁看\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   左边是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   甩锅小算盘，同时想通过政策的不断反复，操纵资本市场，以实现家族成员和华尔街朋友们的最大盈利\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   而右边美联储一方面是【不粘锅】，二是继续夯实自己的【独立可信】人设\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我为什么用人设这个词，巫师以前在投行的时候，也以为他们是【先进的】、【文明的】、【复杂的】、【高级的】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   当民众试图了解美联储的政策时，常常陷入金融知识的复杂性中，而这正是上层希望民众保持的状态，就是懂一点，但还是云里雾里，尤其是面对美联储官方发布的那些大量的研究报告，12个人的利率观点分布，经济论文，各种晦涩的经济理论和函数，看起来那么厚重，那么专业，那么厉害\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我也可以从那个角度来做一期，我甚至能预判到，有弹幕评论呼吁就要硬核干燥，就要进入美联储的话语体系中，那你就上套了，因为你会看到这些、这些、这些、这些、这些、这些（\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   6\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   个）\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCwVfHkT912Via5xO5CnDmmZUMOOCb5uv8Jt5iccXqDepV496VH0m6QsBw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCzYqwRLroB82FibOMY6o0pdzS48Mgz47xgHunibQhY3TbS7AIcSoPofww/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCGCYWHv7mQu9XIz6IGTJRHEArTTUW9GiaIJib2U597iaLhLKGBtHvlNESQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCY8nIY1DNIclCtXgvPnl257LYNUqMUhRhmpaicdic2wtjXmB8zGCMJC2w/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCicHWdL8nZXguiasK4MtJia6mWgezppzBhk6dDSq2sXVaZibtBE0GaTOAaw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCcdxzxmibfypYicrmuL8RDGaEJc0iaEmZibZr3JppvwaG18heiaic1gh7zkYg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我就算把这些模块化的、标准化的，卖方用来做研究的模板给过一遍，对的，我们有个大Excel文件，里面全是这些图，写好公式可以调用Bloomberg的接口实时刷出最新数据，图就自动更新了，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   dirty work\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   做多了我也会背了，只不过我能不能给大家说明白，我不敢保证，但我可以保证一点，就是那会儿大家不是睡了就是跑了，本来评论区就经常说我靡靡之音容易犯困，你们动不动就先睡为敬\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   但其中还算有点用的，就是对美联储\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   12\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   人本身的研究，就是看他们的言论来预判未来的货币政策\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCIodNQKgOBwc2zyGXsTcwZsliaxUJtbsKN4fbI6gAaibKqwia55ibv5Ejrw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   你看外资\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   House\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的研报，特别喜欢把这\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   12\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   个人分为鸽派和鹰派，但我觉得这就像锄地的农民幻想皇帝的生活，就是用金锄头锄地，这种感觉，我甚至觉得这也是一种分析师们的美化，美化美联储的高级感，美化自己研究的复杂性和不可替代性，其实根本没那么复杂，好像他们内部真的有那么多，严肃又高级又复杂的\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   学术讨论\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   一样，还分拨分派的，人五人六的\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我以一个基层分析师做\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   dirty work\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的视角，可能有点井底之蛙，但我觉得，其实很多人都是摆设，其实就听那两三个人的，甚至【两三个】这个量词，我都是多说了\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   大量的文件、报告和数据，其实都是有模板的，我们每次下载下来最新的版本，其实都是用工具去找和上一个版本的区别，而其中大段大段的内容，都是冗余重复的，我自己称他为【金融屎山】，我以前也会跟我同事抱怨，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   nm\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   怎么这么多废话，而且都是专有名词和术语的堆叠，大量复杂的算法和函数的堆积\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   论文和研究报告更是一堆屎，但没办法大家必须赤石，毕竟金融从业者都觉得美联储公布的东西都是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   圣旨\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   啊\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   里面真正的干货有没有？\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   有\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   但我得在几百吨屎里找那几百克融化了的巧克力，而我为了完成\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   dirty work\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ，我必须得尝，因为我光靠看和闻还不够，分辨不出来，人家确实很专业，内容确实极其详实，我不尝，我就没发分辨这一坨到底是史还是巧克力，等我知道它是史了，它的味道已经留在我的唇齿之间久久不能散去了，然后我要再继续去尝下一坨\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   所以我很多时候觉得我在害人，很多人看了我早期的视频，觉得投行很酷，不明觉厉，决定去学金融去干金融，结果一入行，发现完蛋了被迫吃屎，而且那时候回头也晚了，最惨的是金融行业还降薪了，早年投行收入还是可以随便碾压普通人的，但等我的观众入职时已经很多年之后了\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: no', 1, 1, '<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.7; text-align: left; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); min-height: 29px; font-size: 29px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   恩怨\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   大好我巫师，美联储和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的资本博弈，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   看似都是为公为民，但背地里都是一万个心眼\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   宏观经济和货币政策的算法我认为都是配菜，我看到的主线就三个大字\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   【不粘锅】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump2017\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   年提名鲍威尔担任美联储主席，彼时\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   期待鲍威尔延续低利率政策以刺激经济，这样\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   可以交上一份【把经济搞好了】的答卷\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   但鲍威尔上任后，反手给了\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   一刀，也表演了一出【看看我们美联储多美独立】的戏码，鲍威尔为应对通胀风险于\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   18\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   年启动加息，与\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   背道而驰。\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump就\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   公开说鲍威尔为\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   笨蛋\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   最大敌人\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，那会儿就开始威胁解雇鲍威尔了，但鲍威尔强调政策是基于经济而非政治\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   巫师认为那会儿就已经演上了，然后\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第二任期时，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   依旧希望美联储可以尽快降息以实现短期内的乐观经济数据，美联储继续展示自己的独立性\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   我就不！我就不！\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   当然\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   同时也是演给选民看，你美联储不降息就是故意和政敌联手搞我，故意把经济弄得那么差，但美联储则说\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的关税政策才是罪魁祸首，并可能引发\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   滞胀\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   （我关税战视频\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   01-04\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   已经多次提到过滞涨，不再重复）\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   然后\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   继续威胁解雇鲍威尔，都是老一套，而所谓的解雇也是纯纯做梦，理论上存在通路，但事实上难以落地\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   还试图通过设立\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   影子美联储主席\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   推动最高法院裁决等方式削弱鲍威尔权威，但反而给了鲍威尔更大的表演舞台，誓言捍卫独立性，反而显得美联储更加\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   伟光正”，好几届美联储主席都有过相似的表演，为什么巫师老说人家是表演，你看完你就会理解我\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; line-height: 1.7; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); min-height: 24px; font-size: 24px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   为什么死活不降息\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   美联储死活不降息也是有道理的，人家是有阵痛的，50年前美联储迎合白宫的超宽松货币政策，导致高通胀与高失业并存，瞎干比不干更糟糕\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   此外，美联储因低估通胀而被迫激进加息的教训历历在目，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   2021\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   被诟病延续\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   后视镜决策\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，让美联储对政策转向更加谨慎\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   但我们更深一步，白宫和美联储的较量历史由来已久，其实每个年代的较量都脱不开【分锅】这个主题，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   想要甩锅，美联储又何尝不想呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   美联储如果很早就降息，一旦通胀失控，那\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   就可以怪物价上涨是美联储的锅，美联储也知道这一点，自然不能\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   瓜田李下\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，到时候大家也不知道是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   齐宣王的锅更多，还是美联储【不够独立从而提前降息】的锅更多，美联储要干的就俩事，一是【物价】，也就是抑制通胀，二是【就业】，但物价才是民众最能直接感受到的【经济答卷】，而物价的本质就是美元的购买力，Which是美联储的核心任务，而美联储死活不降息，可将可能使物价抬头责任\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   100%\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   指向总统，同时还能展现自己【独立】和【强硬】的人设，一石二鸟\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   相反的，如果真迫于压力降息了，汇率更崩，通胀更猛，加息三年的成果短时间内被消耗殆尽，等物价真崩了，民众发现WOC我竟然我是那个代价，五十万马克一个面包的故事大家听过吗，落榜美术生的故事听过吧，不是美术生会飞，而是他会借势飞升，什么势？民粹之势，就算一切还没那么糟糕，内部矛盾还没膨胀到爆炸，美联储再想修复信用要么像沃尔克硬着陆出清，要么就用美联储再当十年老鼠来填补，无论怎么样，站在美联储角度，别看他站在经济数据和函数计算的话语体系，分析一大堆说不降息，本质上降息后面全是【死门】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   而且以前经济好的时候总统瞎折腾没什么，而在某东方大国的虎视眈眈下，在去美元的压力下，容易一跌不起，照这么折腾，我想问你美国还有几个十年？\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  <br style="visibility: visible;"/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   谁都不想当这个造成一跌不起的罪人\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   再有，美元的高利率说白了就是维持美元吸引力，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   4.5\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的基准利率仍能吸引国际资本流入美债。而美国资本市场已形成复杂的嵌套对冲机制，降息可能导致利差收窄、跨境资本流出，进而引发\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   股债汇三杀\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ，那会儿的美联储会更难受，形成\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   降息\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   →\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   资本外逃\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   →又\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   被迫加息\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的尴尬境地，等到那会儿，民众可是不懂宏观经济的，一看你美联储朝令夕改的狼狈样子，就感觉是你美联储犯了大错，反而白宫就能美美隐身\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   那如果你是美联储主席，你应该怎么办呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   巫师带入鲍威尔的角色，如果是我，就一个字\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   拖\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第一，拖到总统的政策对经济冲击充分显现，将经济疲软归因于白宫\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第二，拖到通胀数据明确降温，为降息提供合理依据\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   第三，拖到资本市场风险出清，避免政策调整触发系统性危机\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   即使我的任期到了，美联储依旧会遵循不粘锅理论，我美联储的耐心和演技，比你\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n   的任期更坚挺\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.3; visibility: visible;">\n <span style="font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); min-height: 15px; font-size: 15px; visibility: visible;">\n  <span style="visibility: visible;">\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.7;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(26, 26, 26);min-height: 24px;font-size: 24px;">\n  <span>\n   演给谁看\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   左边是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   甩锅小算盘，同时想通过政策的不断反复，操纵资本市场，以实现家族成员和华尔街朋友们的最大盈利\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   而右边美联储一方面是【不粘锅】，二是继续夯实自己的【独立可信】人设\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我为什么用人设这个词，巫师以前在投行的时候，也以为他们是【先进的】、【文明的】、【复杂的】、【高级的】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   当民众试图了解美联储的政策时，常常陷入金融知识的复杂性中，而这正是上层希望民众保持的状态，就是懂一点，但还是云里雾里，尤其是面对美联储官方发布的那些大量的研究报告，12个人的利率观点分布，经济论文，各种晦涩的经济理论和函数，看起来那么厚重，那么专业，那么厉害\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我也可以从那个角度来做一期，我甚至能预判到，有弹幕评论呼吁就要硬核干燥，就要进入美联储的话语体系中，那你就上套了，因为你会看到这些、这些、这些、这些、这些、这些（\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   6\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   个）\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCwVfHkT912Via5xO5CnDmmZUMOOCb5uv8Jt5iccXqDepV496VH0m6QsBw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCzYqwRLroB82FibOMY6o0pdzS48Mgz47xgHunibQhY3TbS7AIcSoPofww/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCGCYWHv7mQu9XIz6IGTJRHEArTTUW9GiaIJib2U597iaLhLKGBtHvlNESQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCY8nIY1DNIclCtXgvPnl257LYNUqMUhRhmpaicdic2wtjXmB8zGCMJC2w/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCicHWdL8nZXguiasK4MtJia6mWgezppzBhk6dDSq2sXVaZibtBE0GaTOAaw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCcdxzxmibfypYicrmuL8RDGaEJc0iaEmZibZr3JppvwaG18heiaic1gh7zkYg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我就算把这些模块化的、标准化的，卖方用来做研究的模板给过一遍，对的，我们有个大Excel文件，里面全是这些图，写好公式可以调用Bloomberg的接口实时刷出最新数据，图就自动更新了，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   dirty work\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   做多了我也会背了，只不过我能不能给大家说明白，我不敢保证，但我可以保证一点，就是那会儿大家不是睡了就是跑了，本来评论区就经常说我靡靡之音容易犯困，你们动不动就先睡为敬\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   但其中还算有点用的，就是对美联储\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   12\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   人本身的研究，就是看他们的言论来预判未来的货币政策\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <section powered-by="werss" style="display: inline-block;text-indent: 0px;">\n   <img src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCIodNQKgOBwc2zyGXsTcwZsliaxUJtbsKN4fbI6gAaibKqwia55ibv5Ejrw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 678.765625px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>\n  </section>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   你看外资\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   House\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的研报，特别喜欢把这\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   12\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   个人分为鸽派和鹰派，但我觉得这就像锄地的农民幻想皇帝的生活，就是用金锄头锄地，这种感觉，我甚至觉得这也是一种分析师们的美化，美化美联储的高级感，美化自己研究的复杂性和不可替代性，其实根本没那么复杂，好像他们内部真的有那么多，严肃又高级又复杂的\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   学术讨论\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   一样，还分拨分派的，人五人六的\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我以一个基层分析师做\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   dirty work\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的视角，可能有点井底之蛙，但我觉得，其实很多人都是摆设，其实就听那两三个人的，甚至【两三个】这个量词，我都是多说了\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   大量的文件、报告和数据，其实都是有模板的，我们每次下载下来最新的版本，其实都是用工具去找和上一个版本的区别，而其中大段大段的内容，都是冗余重复的，我自己称他为【金融屎山】，我以前也会跟我同事抱怨，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   nm\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   怎么这么多废话，而且都是专有名词和术语的堆叠，大量复杂的算法和函数的堆积\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   论文和研究报告更是一堆屎，但没办法大家必须赤石，毕竟金融从业者都觉得美联储公布的东西都是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   圣旨\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   啊\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   里面真正的干货有没有？\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   有\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   但我得在几百吨屎里找那几百克融化了的巧克力，而我为了完成\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   dirty work\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ，我必须得尝，因为我光靠看和闻还不够，分辨不出来，人家确实很专业，内容确实极其详实，我不尝，我就没发分辨这一坨到底是史还是巧克力，等我知道它是史了，它的味道已经留在我的唇齿之间久久不能散去了，然后我要再继续去尝下一坨\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   所以我很多时候觉得我在害人，很多人看了我早期的视频，觉得投行很酷，不明觉厉，决定去学金融去干金融，结果一入行，发现完蛋了被迫吃屎，而且那时候回头也晚了，最惨的是金融行业还降薪了，早年投行收入还是可以随便碾压普通人的，但等我的观众入职时已经很多年之后了\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   在这段时间，经济环境发生天翻地覆的变化，甚至由于我们同事的女朋友在某书平台上炫富，给投行全行业集体整降薪了，而且这种事儿还出了两次\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   还有，当时很多金融人特别喜欢叫自己金融民工嘛，我以前也是，看起来在自谦，背地里其实是隐隐的傲慢与偏见，但行业由于多重因素的不断降薪后，可能真比不上人家高水平民工的时薪了，咱们大\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   A\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   多长时间没有\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   IPO\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   了，投行部门多久没扩张了，大券商走了多少人了，所有【不明觉厉】的幻象，终将被现实打破\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   美联储也是一样，一通复杂化的数据堆积，其实就是为了展现，我们最后算出来\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   4.5%\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   这个数，不是拍脑袋，而是经过了缜密的几百几千页的计算，经过了美联储内部各个派系的辩论，搞出来的一个【可信任】的【大工程】\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   但现在美联储的【不明觉厉】的幻象，\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;background-color: inherit;">\n  <span>\n   被谁戳破了呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   就是屏幕前的你和我，这回我没开玩笑，而且你使用了【釜底抽薪】这张牌\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.7;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(26, 26, 26);min-height: 24px;font-size: 24px;">\n  <span>\n   釜底抽薪\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   <br/>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.7;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   你们按照我投行底层的井底之蛙视角继续看啊，被全球金融从业者视为圣经的美联储，大家的共识是，美联储不向总统低眉折腰，强硬独立，非常值得信任对吧，从业者常常认为美联储背后的信任是其基石，我刚入行那会儿也是这么想的\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我现在提出我第二个暴论，美联储的根基不在于信任，而在于霸权背后的军事力量\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   靠的是一次又一次的入侵\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   靠的是反对它的政府一个又一个倒台\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   靠的是碍它事儿的民族一次又一次被屠杀\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   比起所谓的信任，拳头\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   才是背后支撑一切的地基，是航母，是隐身战机，是星罗棋布的美军基地，是信息化武器的硬实力碾压，美联储的信任只是表象，而中国人是在一步步蚕食【霸权】的地基，中国的牌叫做釜底抽薪，而霸权一旦松懈，美联储那\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   12\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   个人再怎么表演【信任】，全球的资产阶级也会用脚投票的\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   毕竟，谁赢，他们帮谁\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   黑帮大哥要让大家服帖，要满足两个条件，一是足够残忍，二是武力要能碾压江湖上其他存在，现在旁边坐了一个体型庞大，快速发育的大熊猫，兜里也踹了一堆不可名状武器，这只熊猫也不跟你抢地盘，还笑嘻嘻的和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14.6667px;">\n  <span>\n   黑帮\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   大哥做生意，而且笑的越来越渗人，兜里武器越来越多，越来越看不懂，你是如果是美国，你这个\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   “\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   大哥\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ”\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   还能当得安心吗\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   更离谱的是，自己兜里的武器已经【空心】，厉害是厉害，但是工业能力已经空心化，甚至为了维护老大的威严，不得不和拖鞋军打的有来有回\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">\n  <span>\n   美联储只是美国衰退的修补匠而已\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   只是这个修补匠格外爱惜自己的羽毛，还特别能装\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   当然美联储的强势独立人设目前还是立得住的，但比如网上很多视频吹保罗沃克多么传奇，这种就是把他们往神坛上推了，我不太喜欢，在我看来美联储只是履行最基本的职责，保证货币的稳定而已，巫师自己随着年龄的增加，随着祖国的崛起，美联储的高级感滤镜，一点一点碎掉了\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.7;">\n <span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(26, 26, 26);min-height: 24px;font-size: 24px;">\n  <span>\n   买定离手\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   我做视频时，最近一次新闻发布会美联储强调了关税刺激通胀和失业率上升的担忧。由于\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   Trump\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的贸易政策下经济路径存在不确定性，也就是对中国又打又怂的，美联储采取观望态度\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   光说不练假把式，我这套【不粘锅】理论到底行不行，我来预测一下\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   最近一次议息会议和最近的美联储发言都说观望，所以我们预测个长期的\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   首先我认为未来的三次议息会议都不会降息，也就是\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   6\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   月、\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   7\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   月和\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   9\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   月的三次，就是我说的\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   ——\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   拖\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   在这个基础之上呢\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   Bloomberg上随便搜搜外资House的分析师，他们普遍预计今年将有两次25个基点的降息，而我甚至认为未来五次议息会议都不会降息，而且 Trmup 会越来越怂\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   可能不太符合市面上美联储相关文章视频的主流观点，但以上就是我的愚见了，抛砖引玉，买定离手，还是那句话，预测对了，你赚了就偷偷给我点个关注，预测错了，那你就回来骂我\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="border-bottom: 0px solid black;margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   最后，中美就算现在各退一步，那也有终局之战，躲得过初一躲不过十五，拖也没用，具体去看关税战\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   01\n  </span>\n </span>\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   的论证，现在所有仅仅基于美联储本身的分析，面对咱们的釜底抽薪，都显得非常单薄\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-top: 4px;margin-bottom: 4px;line-height: 1.3;">\n <span style="font-style: normal;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);min-height: 15px;font-size: 15px;">\n  <span>\n   老规矩，本期的图、表、数据、文案都开源，点个关注随便用，老地方取，资本永不眠，下期见\n  </span>\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by="werss" style="margin-bottom: 0px;">\n <span>\n  <br/>\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style="display: none;">\n <mp-style-type data-value="3">\n </mp-style-type>\n</p>', '<p>恩怨</p>\n<p>大好我巫师，美联储和\nTrump\n的资本博弈，\n看似都是为公为民，但背地里都是一万个心眼</p>\n<p>宏观经济和货币政策的算法我认为都是配菜，我看到的主线就三个大字\n——\n【不粘锅】</p>\n<p>Trump2017\n年提名鲍威尔担任美联储主席，彼时\nTrump\n期待鲍威尔延续低利率政策以刺激经济，这样\nTrump\n可以交上一份【把经济搞好了】的答卷</p>\n<p>但鲍威尔上任后，反手给了\nTrump\n一刀，也表演了一出【看看我们美联储多美独立】的戏码，鲍威尔为应对通胀风险于\n18\n年启动加息，与\nTrump\n背道而驰。\nTrump就\n公开说鲍威尔为\n“\n笨蛋\n”\n和\n“\n最大敌人\n”\n，那会儿就开始威胁解雇鲍威尔了，但鲍威尔强调政策是基于经济而非政治</p>\n<p>巫师认为那会儿就已经演上了，然后\nTrump\n第二任期时，\nTrump\n依旧希望美联储可以尽快降息以实现短期内的乐观经济数据，美联储继续展示自己的独立性</p>\n<p>我就不！我就不！</p>\n<p>当然\nTrump\n同时也是演给选民看，你美联储不降息就是故意和政敌联手搞我，故意把经济弄得那么差，但美联储则说\nTrump\n的关税政策才是罪魁祸首，并可能引发\n“\n滞胀\n”\n（我关税战视频\n01-04\n已经多次提到过滞涨，不再重复）</p>\n<p>然后\nTrump\n继续威胁解雇鲍威尔，都是老一套，而所谓的解雇也是纯纯做梦，理论上存在通路，但事实上难以落地</p>\n<p>Trump\n还试图通过设立\n“\n影子美联储主席\n”和\n推动最高法院裁决等方式削弱鲍威尔权威，但反而给了鲍威尔更大的表演舞台，誓言捍卫独立性，反而显得美联储更加\n“\n伟光正”，好几届美联储主席都有过相似的表演，为什么巫师老说人家是表演，你看完你就会理解我</p>\n<p>为什么死活不降息</p>\n<p>美联储死活不降息也是有道理的，人家是有阵痛的，50年前美联储迎合白宫的超宽松货币政策，导致高通胀与高失业并存，瞎干比不干更糟糕</p>\n<p>此外，美联储因低估通胀而被迫激进加息的教训历历在目，\n2021\n被诟病延续\n“\n后视镜决策\n”\n，让美联储对政策转向更加谨慎</p>\n<p>但我们更深一步，白宫和美联储的较量历史由来已久，其实每个年代的较量都脱不开【分锅】这个主题，\nTrump\n想要甩锅，美联储又何尝不想呢</p>\n<p>美联储如果很早就降息，一旦通胀失控，那\nTrump\n就可以怪物价上涨是美联储的锅，美联储也知道这一点，自然不能\n“\n瓜田李下\n”\n，到时候大家也不知道是\nTrump\n齐宣王的锅更多，还是美联储【不够独立从而提前降息】的锅更多，美联储要干的就俩事，一是【物价】，也就是抑制通胀，二是【就业】，但物价才是民众最能直接感受到的【经济答卷】，而物价的本质就是美元的购买力，Which是美联储的核心任务，而美联储死活不降息，可将可能使物价抬头责任\n100%\n指向总统，同时还能展现自己【独立】和【强硬】的人设，一石二鸟</p>\n<p>相反的，如果真迫于压力降息了，汇率更崩，通胀更猛，加息三年的成果短时间内被消耗殆尽，等物价真崩了，民众发现WOC我竟然我是那个代价，五十万马克一个面包的故事大家听过吗，落榜美术生的故事听过吧，不是美术生会飞，而是他会借势飞升，什么势？民粹之势，就算一切还没那么糟糕，内部矛盾还没膨胀到爆炸，美联储再想修复信用要么像沃尔克硬着陆出清，要么就用美联储再当十年老鼠来填补，无论怎么样，站在美联储角度，别看他站在经济数据和函数计算的话语体系，分析一大堆说不降息，本质上降息后面全是【死门】</p>\n<p>而且以前经济好的时候总统瞎折腾没什么，而在某东方大国的虎视眈眈下，在去美元的压力下，容易一跌不起，照这么折腾，我想问你美国还有几个十年？</p>\n<p>谁都不想当这个造成一跌不起的罪人</p>\n<p>再有，美元的高利率说白了就是维持美元吸引力，\n4.5\n的基准利率仍能吸引国际资本流入美债。而美国资本市场已形成复杂的嵌套对冲机制，降息可能导致利差收窄、跨境资本流出，进而引发\n“\n股债汇三杀\n”\n，那会儿的美联储会更难受，形成\n“\n降息\n→\n资本外逃\n→又\n被迫加息\n”\n的尴尬境地，等到那会儿，民众可是不懂宏观经济的，一看你美联储朝令夕改的狼狈样子，就感觉是你美联储犯了大错，反而白宫就能美美隐身</p>\n<p>那如果你是美联储主席，你应该怎么办呢</p>\n<p>巫师带入鲍威尔的角色，如果是我，就一个字\n——\n拖</p>\n<p>第一，拖到总统的政策对经济冲击充分显现，将经济疲软归因于白宫</p>\n<p>第二，拖到通胀数据明确降温，为降息提供合理依据</p>\n<p>第三，拖到资本市场风险出清，避免政策调整触发系统性危机</p>\n<p>即使我的任期到了，美联储依旧会遵循不粘锅理论，我美联储的耐心和演技，比你\nTrump\n的任期更坚挺</p>\n<p>演给谁看</p>\n<p>左边是\nTrump\n甩锅小算盘，同时想通过政策的不断反复，操纵资本市场，以实现家族成员和华尔街朋友们的最大盈利</p>\n<p>而右边美联储一方面是【不粘锅】，二是继续夯实自己的【独立可信】人设</p>\n<p>我为什么用人设这个词，巫师以前在投行的时候，也以为他们是【先进的】、【文明的】、【复杂的】、【高级的】</p>\n<p>当民众试图了解美联储的政策时，常常陷入金融知识的复杂性中，而这正是上层希望民众保持的状态，就是懂一点，但还是云里雾里，尤其是面对美联储官方发布的那些大量的研究报告，12个人的利率观点分布，经济论文，各种晦涩的经济理论和函数，看起来那么厚重，那么专业，那么厉害</p>\n<p>我也可以从那个角度来做一期，我甚至能预判到，有弹幕评论呼吁就要硬核干燥，就要进入美联储的话语体系中，那你就上套了，因为你会看到这些、这些、这些、这些、这些、这些（\n6\n个）</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCwVfHkT912Via5xO5CnDmmZUMOOCb5uv8Jt5iccXqDepV496VH0m6QsBw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCzYqwRLroB82FibOMY6o0pdzS48Mgz47xgHunibQhY3TbS7AIcSoPofww/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCGCYWHv7mQu9XIz6IGTJRHEArTTUW9GiaIJib2U597iaLhLKGBtHvlNESQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCY8nIY1DNIclCtXgvPnl257LYNUqMUhRhmpaicdic2wtjXmB8zGCMJC2w/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCicHWdL8nZXguiasK4MtJia6mWgezppzBhk6dDSq2sXVaZibtBE0GaTOAaw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4"/></p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCcdxzxmibfypYicrmuL8RDGaEJc0iaEmZibZr3JppvwaG18heiaic1gh7zkYg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5"/></p>\n<p>我就算把这些模块化的、标准化的，卖方用来做研究的模板给过一遍，对的，我们有个大Excel文件，里面全是这些图，写好公式可以调用Bloomberg的接口实时刷出最新数据，图就自动更新了，\ndirty work\n做多了我也会背了，只不过我能不能给大家说明白，我不敢保证，但我可以保证一点，就是那会儿大家不是睡了就是跑了，本来评论区就经常说我靡靡之音容易犯困，你们动不动就先睡为敬</p>\n<p>但其中还算有点用的，就是对美联储\n12\n人本身的研究，就是看他们的言论来预判未来的货币政策</p>\n<p><img alt="图片" class="img-responsive img-fluid" loading="lazy" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/A5AZPRIiakEKRkA9sqFZDF4YdR9rT8lhCIodNQKgOBwc2zyGXsTcwZsliaxUJtbsKN4fbI6gAaibKqwia55ibv5Ejrw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;watermark=1&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6"/></p>\n<p>你看外资\nHouse\n的研报，特别喜欢把这\n12\n个人分为鸽派和鹰派，但我觉得这就像锄地的农民幻想皇帝的生活，就是用金锄头锄地，这种感觉，我甚至觉得这也是一种分析师们的美化，美化美联储的高级感，美化自己研究的复杂性和不可替代性，其实根本没那么复杂，好像他们内部真的有那么多，严肃又高级又复杂的\n“\n学术讨论\n”\n一样，还分拨分派的，人五人六的</p>\n<p>我以一个基层分析师做\ndirty work\n的视角，可能有点井底之蛙，但我觉得，其实很多人都是摆设，其实就听那两三个人的，甚至【两三个】这个量词，我都是多说了</p>\n<p>大量的文件、报告和数据，其实都是有模板的，我们每次下载下来最新的版本，其实都是用工具去找和上一个版本的区别，而其中大段大段的内容，都是冗余重复的，我自己称他为【金融屎山】，我以前也会跟我同事抱怨，\nnm\n怎么这么多废话，而且都是专有名词和术语的堆叠，大量复杂的算法和函数的堆积</p>\n<p>论文和研究报告更是一堆屎，但没办法大家必须赤石，毕竟金融从业者都觉得美联储公布的东西都是\n“\n圣旨\n”\n啊</p>\n<p>里面真正的干货有没有？</p>\n<p>有</p>\n<p>但我得在几百吨屎里找那几百克融化了的巧克力，而我为了完成\ndirty work\n，我必须得尝，因为我光靠看和闻还不够，分辨不出来，人家确实很专业，内容确实极其详实，我不尝，我就没发分辨这一坨到底是史还是巧克力，等我知道它是史了，它的味道已经留在我的唇齿之间久久不能散去了，然后我要再继续去尝下一坨</p>\n<p>所以我很多时候觉得我在害人，很多人看了我早期的视频，觉得投行很酷，不明觉厉，决定去学金融去干金融，结果一入行，发现完蛋了被迫吃屎，而且那时候回头也晚了，最惨的是金融行业还降薪了，早年投行收入还是可以随便碾压普通人的，但等我的观众入职时已经很多年之后了</p>\n<p>在这段时间，经济环境发生天翻地覆的变化，甚至由于我们同事的女朋友在某书平台上炫富，给投行全行业集体整降薪了，而且这种事儿还出了两次</p>\n<p>还有，当时很多金融人特别喜欢叫自己金融民工嘛，我以前也是，看起来在自谦，背地里其实是隐隐的傲慢与偏见，但行业由于多重因素的不断降薪后，可能真比不上人家高水平民工的时薪了，咱们大\nA\n多长时间没有\nIPO\n了，投行部门多久没扩张了，大券商走了多少人了，所有【不明觉厉】的幻象，终将被现实打破</p>\n<p>美联储也是一样，一通复杂化的数据堆积，其实就是为了展现，我们最后算出来\n4.5%\n这个数，不是拍脑袋，而是经过了缜密的几百几千页的计算，经过了美联储内部各个派系的辩论，搞出来的一个【可信任】的【大工程】</p>\n<p>但现在美联储的【不明觉厉】的幻象，\n被谁戳破了呢</p>\n<p>就是屏幕前的你和我，这回我没开玩笑，而且你使用了【釜底抽薪】这张牌</p>\n<p>釜底抽薪</p>\n<p>你们按照我投行底层的井底之蛙视角继续看啊，被全球金融从业者视为圣经的美联储，大家的共识是，美联储不向总统低眉折腰，强硬独立，非常值得信任对吧，从业者常常认为美联储背后的信任是其基石，我刚入行那会儿也是这么想的</p>\n<p>我现在提出我第二个暴论，美联储的根基不在于信任，而在于霸权背后的军事力量</p>\n<p>靠的是一次又一次的入侵</p>\n<p>靠的是反对它的政府一个又一个倒台</p>\n<p>靠的是碍它事儿的民族一次又一次被屠杀</p>\n<p>比起所谓的信任，拳头\n——\n才是背后支撑一切的地基，是航母，是隐身战机，是星罗棋布的美军基地，是信息化武器的硬实力碾压，美联储的信任只是表象，而中国人是在一步步蚕食【霸权】的地基，中国的牌叫做釜底抽薪，而霸权一旦松懈，美联储那\n12\n个人再怎么表演【信任】，全球的资产阶级也会用脚投票的</p>\n<p>毕竟，谁赢，他们帮谁</p>\n<p>黑帮大哥要让大家服帖，要满足两个条件，一是足够残忍，二是武力要能碾压江湖上其他存在，现在旁边坐了一个体型庞大，快速发育的大熊猫，兜里也踹了一堆不可名状武器，这只熊猫也不跟你抢地盘，还笑嘻嘻的和\n黑帮\n大哥做生意，而且笑的越来越渗人，兜里武器越来越多，越来越看不懂，你是如果是美国，你这个\n“\n大哥\n”\n还能当得安心吗</p>\n<p>更离谱的是，自己兜里的武器已经【空心】，厉害是厉害，但是工业能力已经空心化，甚至为了维护老大的威严，不得不和拖鞋军打的有来有回</p>\n<p>美联储只是美国衰退的修补匠而已</p>\n<p>只是这个修补匠格外爱惜自己的羽毛，还特别能装</p>\n<p>当然美联储的强势独立人设目前还是立得住的，但比如网上很多视频吹保罗沃克多么传奇，这种就是把他们往神坛上推了，我不太喜欢，在我看来美联储只是履行最基本的职责，保证货币的稳定而已，巫师自己随着年龄的增加，随着祖国的崛起，美联储的高级感滤镜，一点一点碎掉了</p>\n<p>买定离手</p>\n<p>我做视频时，最近一次新闻发布会美联储强调了关税刺激通胀和失业率上升的担忧。由于\nTrump\n的贸易政策下经济路径存在不确定性，也就是对中国又打又怂的，美联储采取观望态度</p>\n<p>光说不练假把式，我这套【不粘锅】理论到底行不行，我来预测一下</p>\n<p>最近一次议息会议和最近的美联储发言都说观望，所以我们预测个长期的</p>\n<p>首先我认为未来的三次议息会议都不会降息，也就是\n6\n月、\n7\n月和\n9\n月的三次，就是我说的\n——\n拖</p>\n<p>在这个基础之上呢</p>\n<p>Bloomberg上随便搜搜外资House的分析师，他们普遍预计今年将有两次25个基点的降息，而我甚至认为未来五次议息会议都不会降息，而且 Trmup 会越来越怂</p>\n<p>可能不太符合市面上美联储相关文章视频的主流观点，但以上就是我的愚见了，抛砖引玉，买定离手，还是那句话，预测对了，你赚了就偷偷给我点个关注，预测错了，那你就回来骂我</p>\n<p>最后，中美就算现在各退一步，那也有终局之战，躲得过初一躲不过十五，拖也没用，具体去看关税战\n01\n的论证，现在所有仅仅基于美联储本身的分析，面对咱们的釜底抽薪，都显得非常单薄</p>\n<p>老规矩，本期的图、表、数据、文案都开源，点个关注随便用，老地方取，资本永不眠，下期见</p>', '3533686744-2247485813_1')
